    "Beta (for testers)": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бэта (для тэсціроўшчыкаў)"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (per a provadors)"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (pro testery)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (für Tester)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (para testers)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bêta (pour les testeurs)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"बीटा (परीक्षकों के लिए)"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Béta (tesztelőknek)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (untuk penguji)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (per i tester)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ベータ版（テスター向け）"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ბეტა (ტესტერებისთვის)"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бета (тестерлерге арналған)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"베타 (테스터용)"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (untuk penguji)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bèta (voor testers)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (dla testerów)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (para testadores)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (para quem testa)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бета (для тестировщиков)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (za testere)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (för testare)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เบต้า (สำหรับผู้ทดสอบ)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (para sa mga tester)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (test edenler için)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бета (для тестувальників)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta (cho người thử nghiệm)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"测试版（面向测试人员）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta 版（供測試人員使用）"}}}},
    "Beta: every new version as soon as it is built, before it is tested. Back on Stable, the beta you have stays until a newer stable version comes out.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бэта: кожная новая версія адразу пасля зборкі, яшчэ да праверкі. Пасля вяртання на «Стабільны» ўсталяваная бэта застаецца, пакуль не выйдзе навейшая стабільная версія."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: cada versió nova tan bon punt es compila, abans de provar-la. En tornar a Estable, la beta instal·lada es manté fins que surti una versió estable més nova."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: každá nová verze hned po sestavení, ještě před otestováním. Po návratu na kanál Stabilní zůstane nainstalovaná beta, dokud nevyjde novější stabilní verze."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: jede neue Version, sobald sie gebaut ist, noch bevor sie getestet wurde. Zurück auf Stabil bleibt die installierte Beta, bis eine neuere stabile Version erscheint."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: cada versión nueva en cuanto se compila, antes de probarla. Al volver a Estable, la beta instalada se queda hasta que salga una versión estable más reciente."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bêta : chaque nouvelle version dès qu'elle est compilée, avant d'être testée. De retour sur Stable, la bêta installée reste jusqu'à la sortie d'une version stable plus récente."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"बीटा: हर नया संस्करण बनते ही, परीक्षण से पहले। स्थिर चैनल पर लौटने पर, नया स्थिर संस्करण आने तक इंस्टॉल किया गया बीटा बना रहता है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Béta: minden új verzió, amint elkészül, még tesztelés előtt. Ha visszavált a Stabil csatornára, a telepített béta megmarad, amíg újabb stabil verzió meg nem jelenik."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: setiap versi baru begitu selesai dibuat, sebelum diuji. Saat kembali ke Stabil, beta yang terpasang tetap ada sampai versi stabil yang lebih baru keluar."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: ogni nuova versione appena compilata, prima di essere testata. Tornando a Stabile, la beta installata resta finché non esce una versione stabile più recente."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ベータ版：新しいバージョンをビルド直後、テスト前に受け取ります。安定版に戻しても、より新しい安定版が出るまでは今のベータ版のままです。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ბეტა: ყოველი ახალი ვერსია აწყობისთანავე, ტესტირებამდე. სტაბილურზე დაბრუნებისას, თქვენი ბეტა რჩება, სანამ უფრო ახალი სტაბილური ვერსია არ გამოვა."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бета: әр жаңа нұсқа құрастырылған бойда, тексерілмей тұрып. «Тұрақты» арнасына қайтқанда, жаңарақ тұрақты нұсқа шыққанша орнатылған бета қала береді."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"베타: 새 버전이 빌드되는 즉시, 테스트 전에 받습니다. 안정 버전으로 돌아가도 더 새로운 안정 버전이 나올 때까지 설치된 베타가 유지됩니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: setiap versi baharu sebaik sahaja dibina, sebelum diuji. Apabila kembali ke Stabil, beta yang dipasang kekal sehingga versi stabil yang lebih baharu dikeluarkan."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bèta: elke nieuwe versie zodra die gebouwd is, nog voordat die getest is. Terug op Stabiel blijft de geïnstalleerde bèta staan tot er een nieuwere stabiele versie uitkomt."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: każda nowa wersja zaraz po zbudowaniu, zanim zostanie przetestowana. Po powrocie do kanału Stabilny zainstalowana beta zostaje, dopóki nie wyjdzie nowsza wersja stabilna."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: cada nova versão assim que é compilada, antes de ser testada. De volta ao Estável, a beta instalada fica até sair uma versão estável mais recente."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: cada nova versão assim que é compilada, antes de ser testada. De volta ao Estável, a beta instalada mantém-se até sair uma versão estável mais recente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бета: каждая новая версия сразу после сборки, ещё до проверки. При возврате на «Стабильный» установленная бета остаётся до выхода более новой стабильной версии."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: svaka nova verzija čim se napravi, pre nego što se testira. Nazad na stabilnu verziju, beta koju imate ostaje sve dok ne izađe novija stabilna verzija."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: varje ny version så snart den är byggd, innan den har testats. Tillbaka på Stabil ligger den installerade betan kvar tills en nyare stabil version kommer ut."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เบต้า: ได้รับทุกเวอร์ชันใหม่ทันทีที่สร้างเสร็จ ก่อนผ่านการทดสอบ เมื่อกลับไปใช้ช่องทางเสถียร เบต้าที่ติดตั้งไว้จะยังอยู่จนกว่าจะมีเวอร์ชันเสถียรที่ใหม่กว่า"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: bawat bagong bersyon agad pagkabuo, bago masubukan. Pagbalik sa Stable, mananatili ang naka-install na beta hanggang may lumabas na mas bagong stable na bersyon."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: her yeni sürüm, derlenir derlenmez, test edilmeden önce. Kararlı'ya dönünce, daha yeni bir kararlı sürüm çıkana kadar kurulu beta kalır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бета: кожна нова версія одразу після збирання, ще до перевірки. Після повернення на «Стабільний» встановлена бета лишається, доки не вийде новіша стабільна версія."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta: mỗi phiên bản mới ngay khi được biên dịch, trước khi được thử nghiệm. Khi quay lại Ổn định, bản beta đã cài vẫn được giữ cho đến khi có phiên bản ổn định mới hơn."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"测试版：每个新版本构建完成后立即提供，尚未经过测试。改回稳定版后，已安装的测试版会保留，直到发布更新的稳定版。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beta 版：每個新版本一建置完成就提供，尚未經過測試。改回穩定版後，已安裝的 Beta 版會保留，直到推出更新的穩定版。"}}}},
