    "Confirm session": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пацвердзіць сесію"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirma la sessió"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Potvrdit relaci"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sitzung bestätigen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmar sesión"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmer la session"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सेशन की पुष्टि करें"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Munkamenet megerősítése"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konfirmasi sesi"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conferma sessione"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"セッションを確認"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"სესიის დადასტურება"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сессияны растау"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"세션 확인"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sahkan sesi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sessie bevestigen"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Potwierdź sesję"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmar sessão"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmar sessão"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подтвердить сессию"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Potvrdi sesiju"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bekräfta sessionen"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ยืนยันเซสชัน"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kumpirmahin ang session"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oturumu onayla"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Підтвердити сесію"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xác nhận phiên"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"确认会话"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認房間"}}}},
    "Confirm the session first, then choose your bus on the Drive page. The game has not connected yet.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Спачатку пацвердзіце сесію, потым выберыце аўтобус на старонцы «Ехаць». Гульня яшчэ не падключана."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirma primer la sessió i després tria l'autobús a Condueix. El joc encara no s'ha connectat."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nejprve potvrďte relaci, pak vyberte autobus na stránce Jet. Hra se zatím nepřipojila."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bestätige zuerst die Sitzung und wähle dann deinen Bus auf der Seite „Fahren“. Das Spiel ist noch nicht verbunden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirma primero la sesión y luego elige tu autobús en la página Conducir. El juego aún no se ha conectado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmez d'abord la session, puis choisissez votre bus sur la page Conduire. Le jeu n'est pas encore connecté."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"पहले सेशन की पुष्टि करें, फिर ड्राइव पेज पर अपनी बस चुनें। गेम अभी जुड़ा नहीं है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Először erősítsd meg a munkamenetet, majd válassz buszt a Vezetés oldalon. A játék még nem csatlakozott."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konfirmasi sesi dulu, lalu pilih bus di halaman Mengemudi. Game belum terhubung."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conferma prima la sessione, poi scegli il tuo autobus nella pagina Guida. Il gioco non è ancora connesso."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"まずセッションを確認し、「運転」ページでバスを選んでください。まだ接続していません。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ჯერ დაადასტურეთ სესია, შემდეგ აირჩიეთ ავტობუსი „მართვის“ გვერდზე. თამაში ჯერ არ დაკავშირებულა."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Алдымен сессияны растаңыз, сосын Жүру бетінде автобусты таңдаңыз. Ойын әлі қосылған жоқ."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"먼저 세션을 확인한 다음 '운전' 페이지에서 버스를 선택하세요. 아직 연결되지 않았습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sahkan sesi dahulu, kemudian pilih bas di halaman Pandu. Permainan belum bersambung."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bevestig eerst de sessie en kies dan je bus op de pagina Rijden. Het spel is nog niet verbonden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Najpierw potwierdź sesję, potem wybierz autobus na stronie Jedź. Gra jeszcze się nie połączyła."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirme a sessão primeiro e depois escolha seu ônibus na página Dirigir. O jogo ainda não se conectou."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirme primeiro a sessão e depois escolha o seu autocarro na página Conduzir. O jogo ainda não se ligou."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сначала подтвердите сессию, затем выберите автобус на странице «Поездка». Игра ещё не подключена."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Najpre potvrdite sesiju, pa izaberite autobus na stranici „Vožnja“. Igra se još nije povezala."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bekräfta sessionen först och välj sedan din buss på sidan Kör. Spelet är inte anslutet än."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ยืนยันเซสชันก่อน แล้วเลือกรถบัสที่หน้า “ขับรถ” เกมยังไม่ได้เชื่อมต่อ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kumpirmahin muna ang session, saka pumili ng bus sa page na Magmaneho. Hindi pa nakakonekta ang laro."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Önce oturumu onaylayın, sonra Sürüş sayfasında otobüsünüzü seçin. Oyun henüz bağlanmadı."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Спочатку підтвердьте сесію, потім виберіть автобус на сторінці «Їхати». Гра ще не підключена."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hãy xác nhận phiên trước, rồi chọn xe buýt ở trang Lái xe. Trò chơi chưa kết nối."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先确认会话，再到“驾驶”页面选择巴士。目前尚未连接。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先確認房間，再到「駕駛」頁選車。目前尚未連線。"}}}},
    "Connect by Code": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Падключэнне па кодзе"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connecta amb un codi"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Připojit kódem"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Per Code verbinden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conectar por código"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connexion par code"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कोड से जुड़ें"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Csatlakozás kóddal"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hubungkan dengan kode"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connetti con codice"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コードで接続"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კოდით შეერთება"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Код бойынша қосылу"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"코드로 연결"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sambung dengan kod"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verbinden met code"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Połącz kodem"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conectar por código"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conectar por código"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подключение по коду"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povežite se pomoću koda"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anslut med kod"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เชื่อมต่อด้วยรหัส"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kumonekta gamit ang code"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kodla Bağlan"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Підключення за кодом"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kết nối bằng mã"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通过会话码连接"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用連線碼連線"}}}},
    "Connect the iPhone or iPad to the Mac with a cable.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Падключыце iPhone або iPad да Mac кабелем."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connecta l'iPhone o l'iPad al Mac amb un cable."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Připojte iPhone nebo iPad k Macu kabelem."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verbinde das iPhone oder iPad per Kabel mit dem Mac."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conecta el iPhone o iPad al Mac con un cable."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Branchez l'iPhone ou l'iPad au Mac avec un câble."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone या iPad को केबल से Mac से जोड़ें।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Csatlakoztasd az iPhone-t vagy az iPadet kábellel a Machez."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hubungkan iPhone atau iPad ke Mac dengan kabel."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collega l'iPhone o l'iPad al Mac con un cavo."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhoneまたはiPadをケーブルでMacに接続します。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"შეაერთეთ iPhone ან iPad Mac-თან კაბელით."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone не iPad-ты Mac-қа кабельмен қосыңыз."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone 또는 iPad를 케이블로 Mac에 연결하세요."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sambungkan iPhone atau iPad ke Mac dengan kabel."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sluit de iPhone of iPad met een kabel aan op de Mac."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Podłącz iPhone’a lub iPada do Maca kablem."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conecte o iPhone ou iPad ao Mac com um cabo."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ligue o iPhone ou iPad ao Mac com um cabo."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подключите iPhone или iPad к Mac кабелем."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povežite iPhone ili iPad sa Mac računarom pomoću kabla."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anslut iPhone eller iPad till Macen med en kabel."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เชื่อมต่อ iPhone หรือ iPad กับ Mac ด้วยสายเคเบิล"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ikonekta ang iPhone o iPad sa Mac gamit ang cable."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone'u veya iPad'i Mac'e kabloyla bağlayın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Під'єднайте iPhone або iPad до Mac кабелем."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kết nối iPhone hoặc iPad với máy Mac bằng cáp."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用数据线将iPhone或iPad连接到Mac。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"以傳輸線將 iPhone 或 iPad 連接到 Mac。"}}}},
    "Connect the iPhone or iPad with a cable, then open Files (File Sharing in iTunes).": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Падключыце iPhone або iPad кабелем, потым адкрыйце «Файлы» («Агульны доступ да файлаў» у iTunes)."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connecta l'iPhone o l'iPad amb un cable i obre Fitxers (Compartició de fitxers a l'iTunes)."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Připojte iPhone nebo iPad kabelem, pak otevřete „Soubory“ („Sdílení souborů“ v iTunes)."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verbinde das iPhone oder iPad per Kabel und öffne dann Dateien (Dateifreigabe in iTunes)."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conecta el iPhone o iPad con un cable y abre Archivos (Compartir archivos en iTunes)."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Branchez l'iPhone ou l'iPad avec un câble, puis ouvrez Fichiers (Partage de fichiers dans iTunes)."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone या iPad को केबल से जोड़ें, फिर फ़ाइलें खोलें (iTunes में फ़ाइल शेयरिंग)।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Csatlakoztasd az iPhone-t vagy az iPadet kábellel, majd nyisd meg a „Fájlok” lapot (iTunesban „Fájlmegosztás”)."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hubungkan iPhone atau iPad dengan kabel, lalu buka File (Berbagi File di iTunes)."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collega l'iPhone o l'iPad con un cavo, poi apri File (Condivisione file in iTunes)."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhoneまたはiPadをケーブルで接続し、「ファイル」を開きます（iTunesでは「ファイル共有」）。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"შეაერთეთ iPhone ან iPad კაბელით, შემდეგ გახსენით „ფაილები“ (iTunes-ში ფაილების გაზიარება)."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone не iPad-ты кабельмен қосыңыз, содан кейін «Файлдар» бөлімін ашыңыз (iTunes-те «Файлдарды бөлісу»)."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone 또는 iPad를 케이블로 연결한 다음 파일을 여세요(iTunes에서는 파일 공유)."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sambungkan iPhone atau iPad dengan kabel, kemudian buka Fail (Perkongsian Fail dalam iTunes)."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sluit de iPhone of iPad aan met een kabel en open Bestanden (Bestandsdeling in iTunes)."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Podłącz iPhone’a lub iPada kablem, potem otwórz „Pliki” („Udostępnianie plików” w iTunes)."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conecte o iPhone ou iPad com um cabo e abra Arquivos (Compartilhamento de Arquivos no iTunes)."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ligue o iPhone ou iPad com um cabo e abra Ficheiros (Partilha de ficheiros no iTunes)."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подключите iPhone или iPad кабелем, затем откройте «Файлы» («Общие файлы» в iTunes)."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povežite iPhone ili iPad kablom, a zatim otvorite Datoteke (Deljenje datoteka u iTunes-u)."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anslut iPhone eller iPad med en kabel och öppna Filer (Fildelning i iTunes)."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เชื่อมต่อ iPhone หรือ iPad ด้วยสายเคเบิล แล้วเปิด “ไฟล์” (“การแชร์ไฟล์” ใน iTunes)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ikonekta ang iPhone o iPad gamit ang cable, saka buksan ang Files (File Sharing sa iTunes)."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone'u veya iPad'i kabloyla bağlayın, ardından “Dosyalar”ı açın (iTunes'ta “Dosya Paylaşma”)."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Під'єднайте iPhone або iPad кабелем, потім відкрийте «Файли» («Спільний доступ до файлів» в iTunes)."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kết nối iPhone hoặc iPad bằng cáp, rồi mở Tệp (Chia sẻ tệp trong iTunes)."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用数据线连接iPhone或iPad，然后打开“文件”（在iTunes中为“文件共享”）。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"以傳輸線連接 iPhone 或 iPad，然後開啟「檔案」（iTunes 中為「檔案共享」）。"}}}},
    "Connection progress": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ход падключэння"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progrés de la connexió"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Průběh připojení"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verbindungsfortschritt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progreso de la conexión"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progression de la connexion"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कनेक्शन की प्रगति"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kapcsolódás állapota"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progres koneksi"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Avanzamento della connessione"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続の進行状況"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"დაკავშირების პროგრესი"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Қосылу барысы"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결 진행 상황"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kemajuan sambungan"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voortgang verbinding"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Postęp połączenia"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progresso da conexão"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progresso da ligação"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ход подключения"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Napredak povezivanja"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anslutningsförlopp"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ความคืบหน้าการเชื่อมต่อ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Progreso ng koneksyon"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bağlantı durumu"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Хід підключення"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiến trình kết nối"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"连接进度"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"連線進度"}}}},
    "Content folder": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Тэчка змесціва"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Carpeta de contingut"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Složka obsahu"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inhaltsordner"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Carpeta de contenido"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dossier de contenu"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कंटेंट फ़ोल्डर"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tartalommappa"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Folder konten"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cartella dei contenuti"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コンテンツフォルダ"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კონტენტის საქაღალდე"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Контент қалтасы"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"콘텐츠 폴더"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Folder kandungan"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inhoudsmap"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Folder z zawartością"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pasta de conteúdo"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pasta de conteúdo"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Папка контента"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fascikla sa sadržajem"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Innehållsmapp"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"โฟลเดอร์เนื้อหา"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Content folder"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"İçerik klasörü"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Тека вмісту"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thư mục nội dung"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"内容文件夹"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":