    "Continue": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Працягнуць"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokračovat"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fortsetzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuer"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"जारी रखें"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Folytatás"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lanjutkan"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"続きから"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"გაგრძელება"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Жалғастыру"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이어하기"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Teruskan"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Doorgaan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontynuuj"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продолжить"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nastavi"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fortsätt"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เล่นต่อ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ituloy"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Devam et"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продовжити"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiếp tục"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"继续"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"繼續"}}}},
    "Controls": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кіраванне"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controls"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ovládání"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuerung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controles"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Commandes"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कंट्रोल"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Irányítás"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrol"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comandi"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"操作"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მართვის საშუალებები"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Басқару"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"조작 설정"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kawalan"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Besturing"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sterowanie"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controles"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlos"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управление"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrole"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontroller"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การควบคุม"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mga kontrol"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontroller"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керування"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"操控設定"}}}},
    "Controls the vehicles' smoke particles, not scenery effects or glowing particles.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кіруе часціцамі дыму транспарту, не закранаючы эфекты асяроддзя і святлівыя часціцы."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla les partícules de fum dels vehicles, sense afectar els efectes de l'escenari ni les partícules lluminoses."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ovládá kouřové částice vozidel, nikoli efekty okolí nebo svítící částice."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuert die Rauchpartikel der Fahrzeuge, ohne Szenerieeffekte oder leuchtende Partikel zu beeinflussen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla las partículas de humo de los vehículos, sin afectar a los efectos del escenario ni a las partículas luminosas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôle les particules de fumée des véhicules, sans affecter les effets du décor ni les particules lumineuses."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"वाहनों के धुएँ के कणों को नियंत्रित करता है; परिवेश के प्रभावों या चमकते कणों को प्रभावित नहीं करता।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A járművek füstrészecskéit szabályozza, a környezeti hatásokat és a világító részecskéket nem érinti."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mengatur partikel asap kendaraan tanpa memengaruhi efek lingkungan atau partikel bercahaya."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla le particelle di fumo dei veicoli, senza modificare gli effetti dello scenario o le particelle luminose."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"車両の煙パーティクルを制御します。背景のエフェクトや発光パーティクルには影響しません。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მართავს მანქანების კვამლის ნაწილაკებს და არა დეკორაციის ეფექტებს ან მანათობელ ნაწილაკებს."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Көліктердің түтін бөлшектерін басқарады; қоршаған орта әсерлері мен жарқыраған бөлшектерге әсер етпейді."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"차량의 연기 입자를 제어하며 배경 효과나 발광 입자에는 영향을 주지 않습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mengawal zarah asap kenderaan tanpa menjejaskan kesan persekitaran atau zarah bercahaya."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Regelt de rookpartikels van voertuigen, zonder omgevingseffecten of lichtgevende partikels te beïnvloeden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steruje cząsteczkami dymu pojazdów, bez wpływu na efekty otoczenia i świecące cząsteczki."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla as partículas de fumaça dos veículos, sem afetar efeitos do cenário ou partículas luminosas."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla as partículas de fumo dos veículos, sem afetar os efeitos do cenário ou as partículas luminosas."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управляет частицами дыма транспорта, не затрагивая эффекты окружения и светящиеся частицы."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Upravlja česticama dima vozila, bez uticaja na efekte okruženja ili svetleće čestice."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr fordonens rökpartiklar utan att påverka omgivningseffekter eller lysande partiklar."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุมอนุภาคควันของยานพาหนะ โดยไม่กระทบเอฟเฟกต์ฉากหรืออนุภาคเรืองแสง"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kinokontrol ang mga partikulo ng usok ng mga sasakyan, hindi ang mga epekto sa paligid o mga kumikinang na partikulo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Araçların duman parçacıklarını kontrol eder; çevre efektlerini veya ışık yayan parçacıkları etkilemez."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керує частинками диму транспорту, не впливаючи на ефекти оточення та світні частинки."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển các hạt khói của xe, không ảnh hưởng đến hiệu ứng cảnh vật hoặc các hạt phát sáng."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制车辆的烟雾粒子，不影响场景特效或发光粒子。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制車輛的煙霧粒子，不影響場景特效或發光粒子。"}}}},
    "Copy +min": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Капіяваць +хв"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia +min"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopírovat +min"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopie +min"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar +min"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie +min"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कॉपी +मिनट"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Másolás +perc"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin +mnt"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia +min"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"+分をコピー"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ასლი +წთ"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"+мин көшіру"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"복사 +분"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin +min"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopieer +min"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiuj +min"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar +min"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar +min"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Копия +min"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiraj +min"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiera +min"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คัดลอก +นาที"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopyahin +min"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopyala +dk"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Копіювати +хв"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sao chép +phút"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"复制 +分钟"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複製 +分鐘"}}}},
    "Copy OMSI 2 onto this device": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скапіруйце OMSI 2 на гэтую прыладу"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia OMSI 2 en aquest dispositiu"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zkopírujte OMSI 2 do tohoto zařízení"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiere OMSI 2 auf dieses Gerät"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia OMSI 2 en este dispositivo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiez OMSI 2 sur cet appareil"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 को इस डिवाइस पर कॉपी करें"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Másold az OMSI 2-t erre az eszközre"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin OMSI 2 ke perangkat ini"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia OMSI 2 su questo dispositivo"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2をこのデバイスにコピー"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"დააკოპირეთ OMSI 2 ამ მოწყობილობაზე"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2-ні осы құрылғыға көшіріңіз"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2를 이 기기에 복사"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin OMSI 2 ke peranti ini"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopieer OMSI 2 naar dit apparaat"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skopiuj OMSI 2 na to urządzenie"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie o OMSI 2 para este dispositivo"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie o OMSI 2 para este dispositivo"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопируйте OMSI 2 на это устройство"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopirajte OMSI 2 na ovaj uređaj"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiera OMSI 2 till den här enheten"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คัดลอก OMSI 2 ลงในอุปกรณ์นี้"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopyahin ang OMSI 2 sa device na ito"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2'yi bu cihaza kopyalayın"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопіюйте OMSI 2 на цей пристрій"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sao chép OMSI 2 vào thiết bị này"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将OMSI 2复制到此设备"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"將 OMSI 2 複製到此裝置"}}}},
    "Copy a complete OMSI 2 (the folder with Omsi.exe, maps and Vehicles) into openOMSI in the Files app (On My iPhone / iPad), or from a Mac's Finder over a cable, and choose it here. A copy on iCloud Drive or a USB drive can be chosen as well.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скапіюйце поўны OMSI 2 (тэчку з Omsi.exe, maps і Vehicles) у openOMSI у праграме «Файлы» (На iPhone / iPad) або з Finder на Mac праз кабель і выберыце яго тут. Можна выбраць і копію на iCloud Drive або USB-назапашвальніку."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia un OMSI 2 complet (la carpeta amb Omsi.exe, maps i Vehicles) a openOMSI des de l'app Fitxers (Al meu iPhone / iPad), o des del Finder d'un Mac amb un cable, i tria'l aquí. També pots triar una còpia a l'iCloud Drive o en una unitat USB."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zkopírujte kompletní OMSI 2 (složku s Omsi.exe, maps a Vehicles) do openOMSI v aplikaci Soubory (Na mém iPhonu / iPadu), nebo z Finderu na Macu přes kabel, a vyberte ji zde. Lze vybrat i kopii na iCloud Drive nebo na USB disku."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiere ein vollständiges OMSI 2 (den Ordner mit Omsi.exe, maps und Vehicles) in der Dateien-App nach openOMSI (Auf meinem iPhone / iPad) oder per Kabel aus dem Finder eines Macs, und wähle es hier aus. Eine Kopie auf iCloud Drive oder einem USB-Stick kann ebenfalls gewählt werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia un OMSI 2 completo (la carpeta con Omsi.exe, maps y Vehicles) en openOMSI desde la app Archivos (En mi iPhone / iPad), o desde el Finder de un Mac por cable, y elígelo aquí. También puedes elegir una copia en iCloud Drive o en una unidad USB."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiez un OMSI 2 complet (le dossier avec Omsi.exe, maps et Vehicles) dans openOMSI via l'app Fichiers (Sur mon iPhone / iPad), ou depuis le Finder d'un Mac par câble, puis choisissez-le ici. Une copie sur iCloud Drive ou sur une clé USB peut aussi être choisie."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"पूरा OMSI 2 (Omsi.exe, maps और Vehicles वाला फ़ोल्डर) Files ऐप में openOMSI के अंदर (On My iPhone / iPad) कॉपी करें, या केबल से Mac के Finder से, और उसे यहाँ चुनें। iCloud Drive या USB ड्राइव पर रखी कॉपी भी चुनी जा सकती है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Másold a teljes OMSI 2-t (az Omsi.exe, maps és Vehicles tartalmú mappát) az openOMSI-ba a Fájlok appban (Saját iPhone-on / iPaden), vagy egy Mac Finderéből kábelen át, és válaszd ki itt. iCloud Drive-on vagy USB-meghajtón lévő másolat is választható."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin OMSI 2 lengkap (folder berisi Omsi.exe, maps, dan Vehicles) ke openOMSI di app File (Di iPhone / iPad Saya), atau dari Finder Mac lewat kabel, lalu pilih di sini. Salinan di iCloud Drive atau drive USB juga bisa dipilih."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia un OMSI 2 completo (la cartella con Omsi.exe, maps e Vehicles) in openOMSI nell'app File (Sul mio iPhone / iPad), oppure dal Finder di un Mac tramite cavo, e sceglilo qui. Si può scegliere anche una copia su iCloud Drive o su una chiavetta USB."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完全な OMSI 2 (Omsi.exe、maps、Vehicles があるフォルダ) を「ファイル」アプリの openOMSI (このiPhone内 / このiPad内) にコピーするか、ケーブルで接続した Mac の Finder からコピーし、ここで選んでください。iCloud Drive や USB ドライブ上のコピーも選べます。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"დააკოპირეთ სრული OMSI 2 (საქაღალდე Omsi.exe-ით, maps-ით და Vehicles-ით) openOMSI-ში Files აპში (ჩემს iPhone-ზე / iPad-ზე), ან Mac-ის Finder-იდან კაბელით, და აქ აირჩიეთ. ასევე შეიძლება iCloud Drive-ზე ან USB დისკზე არსებული ასლის არჩევა."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Толық OMSI 2 ойынын (Omsi.exe, maps және Vehicles бар қалтаны) Файлдар қолданбасындағы openOMSI ішіне (iPhone / iPad-та) көшіріңіз немесе Mac-тағы Finder арқылы кабельмен көшіріп, осы жерде таңдаңыз. iCloud Drive не USB дискідегі көшірмені де таңдауға болады."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"완전한 OMSI 2 (Omsi.exe, maps, Vehicles가 있는 폴더)를 파일 앱의 openOMSI (나의 iPhone / iPad)에 복사하거나, 케이블로 연결한 Mac의 Finder에서 복사한 뒤 여기서 선택하세요. iCloud Drive나 USB 드라이브에 있는 사본도 선택할 수 있습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin OMSI 2 lengkap (folder dengan Omsi.exe, maps dan Vehicles) ke dalam openOMSI dalam apl Fail (Pada iPhone / iPad Saya), atau dari Finder Mac melalui kabel, kemudian pilih di sini. Salinan pada iCloud Drive atau pemacu USB juga boleh dipilih."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopieer een volledige OMSI 2 (de map met Omsi.exe, maps en Vehicles) in de app Bestanden naar openOMSI (Op mijn iPhone / iPad), of via een kabel vanuit de Finder van een Mac, en kies hem hier. Een kopie op iCloud Drive of een USB-stick kan ook worden gekozen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skopiuj kompletne OMSI 2 (folder z Omsi.exe, maps i Vehicles) do openOMSI w aplikacji Pliki (Na moim iPhonie / iPadzie) lub z Findera na Macu przez kabel i wybierz go tutaj. Można też wybrać kopię na iCloud Drive lub dysku USB."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie um OMSI 2 completo (a pasta com Omsi.exe, maps e Vehicles) para o openOMSI no app Arquivos (No meu iPhone / iPad), ou pelo Finder de um Mac via cabo, e escolha-o aqui. Uma cópia no iCloud Drive ou em um pendrive também pode ser escolhida."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie um OMSI 2 completo (a pasta com Omsi.exe, maps e Vehicles) para o openOMSI na app Ficheiros (No iPhone / iPad), ou a partir do Finder de um Mac por cabo, e escolha-o aqui. Também pode escolher uma cópia no iCloud Drive ou numa pen USB."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопируйте полную OMSI 2 (папку с Omsi.exe, maps и Vehicles) в openOMSI в приложении «Файлы» (На iPhone / iPad) или из Finder на Mac по кабелю и выберите её здесь. Можно выбрать и копию на iCloud Drive или USB-накопителе."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopirajte kompletan OMSI 2 (fasciklu sa Omsi.exe, maps i Vehicles) u openOMSI u aplikaciji Fajlovi (Na mom iPhone-u / iPad-u), ili iz Finder-a na Mac-u preko kabla, i izaberite ga ovde. Može se izabrati i kopija na iCloud Drive-u ili USB disku."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiera ett komplett OMSI 2 (mappen med Omsi.exe, maps och Vehicles) till openOMSI i appen Filer (På min iPhone / iPad), eller från en Macs Finder via kabel, och välj det här. En kopia på iCloud Drive eller ett USB-minne kan också väljas."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คัดลอก OMSI 2 ฉบับสมบูรณ์ (โฟลเดอร์ที่มี Omsi.exe, maps และ Vehicles) ไปไว้ใน openOMSI ในแอปไฟล์ (บน iPhone / iPad ของฉัน) หรือจาก Finder ของ Mac ผ่านสาย แล้วเลือกที่นี่ เลือกสำเนาบน iCloud Drive หรือไดรฟ์ USB ก็ได้"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopyahin ang buong OMSI 2 (ang folder na may Omsi.exe, maps at Vehicles) sa openOMSI sa Files app (On My iPhone / iPad), o mula sa Finder ng Mac gamit ang cable, at piliin ito rito. Puwede ring piliin ang kopya sa iCloud Drive o USB drive."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eksiksiz bir OMSI 2'yi (Omsi.exe, maps ve Vehicles içeren klasör) Dosyalar uygulamasında openOMSI içine (iPhone'umda / iPad'imde) veya kabloyla bir Mac'in Finder'ından kopyalayın ve burada seçin. iCloud Drive'daki veya bir USB sürücüdeki bir kopya da seçilebilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопіюйте повну OMSI 2 (теку з Omsi.exe, maps і Vehicles) в openOMSI у застосунку «Файли» (На iPhone / iPad) або з Finder на Mac через кабель і оберіть її тут. Можна обрати й копію на iCloud Drive чи USB-накопичувачі."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sao chép một bản OMSI 2 đầy đủ (thư mục chứa Omsi.exe, maps và Vehicles) vào openOMSI trong ứng dụng Tệp (Trên iPhone / iPad), hoặc từ Finder của Mac qua cáp, rồi chọn nó ở đây. Cũng có thể chọn bản sao trên iCloud Drive hoặc ổ USB."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将完整的 OMSI 2（含 Omsi.exe、maps 和 Vehicles 的文件夹）复制到“文件”App 中的 openOMSI（我的 iPhone / iPad），或通过数据线从 Mac 的访达复制，然后在这里选择它。也可以选择 iCloud 云盘或 USB 驱动器上的副本。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"將完整的 OMSI 2（含 Omsi.exe、maps 和 Vehicles 的資料夾）複製到「檔案」App 中的 openOMSI（我的 iPhone / iPad），或透過傳輸線從 Mac 的 Finder 複製，然後在這裡選擇它。也可以選擇 iCloud 雲碟或 USB 磁碟上的副本。"}}}},
    "Copy code": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia el codi"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Code kopieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar código"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copier le code"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კოდის კოპირება"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar código"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar código"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопировать код"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiraj kod"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複製連線碼"}}}},
    "Copy report": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia l'informe"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bericht kopieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar informe"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copier le rapport"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ანგარიშის კოპირება"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar relatório"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar relatório"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопировать отчёт"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiraj izveštaj"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複製報告"}}}},
    "Copy the OMSI 2 folder onto a USB drive and plug it into the iPhone or iPad.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скапіруйце тэчку OMSI 2 на USB-назапашвальнік і падключыце яго да iPhone або iPad."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia la carpeta OMSI 2 en una memòria USB i connecta-la a l'iPhone o l'iPad."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zkopírujte složku OMSI 2 na USB disk a připojte ho k iPhonu nebo iPadu."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiere den OMSI-2-Ordner auf einen USB-Stick und stecke ihn ins iPhone oder iPad."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia la carpeta OMSI 2 en una memoria USB y conéctala al iPhone o iPad."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiez le dossier OMSI 2 sur une clé USB et branchez-la sur l'iPhone ou l'iPad."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 फ़ोल्डर को USB ड्राइव पर कॉपी करें और उसे iPhone या iPad में लगाएँ।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Másold az OMSI 2 mappát egy USB-meghajtóra, és csatlakoztasd az iPhone-hoz vagy az iPadhez."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin folder OMSI 2 ke drive USB, lalu colokkan ke iPhone atau iPad."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia la cartella OMSI 2 su una chiavetta USB e collegala all'iPhone o all'iPad."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2フォルダをUSBドライブにコピーし、iPhoneまたはiPadに接続します。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"დააკოპირეთ OMSI 2 საქაღალდე USB დისკზე და შეაერთეთ ის iPhone-თან ან iPad-თან."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 қалтасын USB жинақтағышқа көшіріп, оны iPhone не iPad-қа қосыңыз."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 폴더를 USB 드라이브에 복사한 다음 iPhone 또는 iPad에 연결하세요."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin folder OMSI 2 ke pemacu USB dan sambungkannya ke iPhone atau iPad."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopieer de OMSI 2-map naar een USB-stick en sluit die aan op de iPhone of iPad."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skopiuj folder OMSI 2 na dysk USB i podłącz go do iPhone’a lub iPada."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie a pasta OMSI 2 para um pendrive e conecte-o ao iPhone ou iPad."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie a pasta OMSI 2 para uma pen USB e ligue-a ao iPhone ou iPad."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопируйте папку OMSI 2 на USB-накопитель и подключите его к iPhone или iPad."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopirajte fasciklu OMSI 2 na USB disk i priključite je na iPhone ili iPad."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiera OMSI 2-mappen till ett USB-minne och anslut det till iPhone eller iPad."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คัดลอกโฟลเดอร์ OMSI 2 ลงในไดรฟ์ USB แล้วเสียบเข้ากับ iPhone หรือ iPad"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopyahin ang OMSI 2 folder sa isang USB drive at isaksak ito sa iPhone o iPad."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 klasörünü bir USB belleğe kopyalayın ve iPhone'a veya iPad'e takın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопіюйте теку OMSI 2 на USB-накопичувач і під'єднайте його до iPhone або iPad."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sao chép thư mục OMSI 2 vào ổ USB rồi cắm vào iPhone hoặc iPad."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将OMSI 2文件夹复制到U盘，然后将U盘插入iPhone或iPad。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"將 OMSI 2 資料夾複製到 USB 隨身碟，再將它插入 iPhone 或 iPad。"}}}},
    "Copy the report (the end of the game's log), or open a GitHub issue with it: it tells what went wrong on this computer.": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia l'informe (el final del registre del joc) o obre'n una incidència a GitHub: explica què ha fallat en aquest ordinador."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiere den Bericht (das Ende des Spiel-Logs) oder öffne damit ein GitHub-Issue: er zeigt, was auf diesem Computer schiefgelaufen ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia el informe (el final del registro del juego) o abre una incidencia en GitHub con él: explica qué ha fallado en este equipo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiez le rapport (la fin des logs du jeu) ou ouvrez un ticket GitHub avec : il indique ce qui a mal tourné sur cet ordinateur."}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"დააკოპირეთ ანგარიში (თამაშის ჟურნალის ბოლო) ან გახსენით მასთან ერთად GitHub issue: ის აჩვენებს, რა მოხდა არასწორად ამ კომპიუტერზე."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie o relatório (o final do log do jogo) ou abra uma issue no GitHub com ele: mostra o que deu errado neste computador."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie o relatório (o final do registo do jogo) ou abra uma issue no GitHub com ele: diz o que correu mal neste computador."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скопируйте отчёт (конец журнала игры) или откройте с ним issue на GitHub: он показывает, что пошло не так на этом компьютере."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopirajte izveštaj (kraj dnevnika igre) ili otvorite GitHub problem sa njim: on govori šta je pošlo po zlu na ovom računaru."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複製報告（遊戲記錄的末段），或附上報告在 GitHub 回報問題：報告會說明這台電腦發生的錯誤。"}}}},
    "Corner": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кут"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cantonada"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Roh"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ecke"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esquina"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Coin"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कोना"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sarok"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sudut"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Angolo"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"表示位置"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კუთხე"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Бұрыш"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모서리"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sudut"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoek"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Róg"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canto"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canto"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Угол"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ugao"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hörn"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"มุม"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Corner"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Köşe"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кут"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Góc"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"角落"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"顯示位置"}}}},
    "Count me in the website's \"playing now\" (anonymous)": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compta'm a «jugant ara» del web (anònim)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mich zu \"Spielen aktuell\" auf der Website dazuzählen (anonym)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incluirme en el contador anónimo de jugadores de la web"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Me compter dans les « en jeu maintenant » du site (anonyme)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ჩამთვალეთ საიტის „ახლა თამაშობს“ მრიცხველში (ანონიმურად)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mij anoniem meetellen bij 'nu aan het spelen' op de website"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incluir-me no \"jogando agora\" do site (anônimo)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incluir-me no \"a jogar agora\" do site (anónimo)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Учитывать меня в разделе сайта «сейчас играют» (анонимно)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prikaži moje prisustvo na stranici „Trenutno igraju“ (anonimno)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Räkna med mig i webbplatsens ”spelar nu” (anonymt)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将我计入网站的“正在游玩”人数（匿名）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"將我計入網站的「目前遊玩人數」（匿名）"}}}},
