    "Door buttons": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Botons de les portes"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Türtasten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Botones de las puertas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Boutons des portes"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კარის ღილაკები"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Botões das portas"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Botões das portas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кнопки дверей"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dugmad za vrata"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dörrknappar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"車門按鈕"}}}},
    "Door release (passengers open), any bus": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Desbloqueig de portes (els passatgers les obren), qualsevol autobús"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Türfreigabe (Fahrgäste öffnen), jeder Bus"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Liberación de puertas (los pasajeros las abren), cualquier autobús"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Déverrouillage des portes (les voyageurs ouvrent), tous bus"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კარების განბლოკვა (მგზავრები ხსნიან), ნებისმიერი ავტობუსი"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Liberação das portas (passageiros abrem), qualquer ônibus"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Libertação das portas (os passageiros abrem), qualquer autocarro"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Разблокировка дверей (пассажиры открывают), любой автобус"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Otvaranje vrata (putnici otvoreni), bilo koji autobus"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"車門釋放（乘客開門），適用所有巴士"}}}},
