    "Escape": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esc"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Echap"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escape"}}}},
    "Every change is saved at once; the game reads them when it starts.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожная змена захоўваецца адразу; гульня чытае іх пры запуску."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada canvi es desa immediatament; el joc els llegeix en iniciar-se."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Každá změna se uloží hned; hra je načte při spuštění."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jede Änderung wird sofort gespeichert; das Spiel liest sie beim Start."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada cambio se guarda al instante; el juego los lee al iniciar."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaque modification est enregistrée aussitôt ; le jeu les lit au démarrage."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हर बदलाव तुरंत सेव होता है; गेम शुरू होते समय उन्हें पढ़ता है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minden módosítás azonnal mentésre kerül; a játék induláskor olvassa be őket."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setiap perubahan langsung disimpan dan dibaca saat game dimulai."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ogni modifica viene salvata subito; il gioco le legge all'avvio."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変更はすぐに保存されます。ゲームは起動時にそれらを読み込みます。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყოველი ცვლილება მაშინვე ინახება; თამაში მათ გაშვებისას კითხულობს."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Әрбір өзгеріс бірден сақталады; ойын оларды іске қосылғанда оқиды."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 변경 사항은 즉시 저장되며 게임 시작 시 불러옵니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setiap perubahan disimpan serta-merta dan dibaca apabila permainan bermula."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elke wijziging wordt direct opgeslagen; het spel leest ze bij het starten."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Każda zmiana jest zapisywana od razu; gra wczytuje je przy starcie."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada alteração é salva imediatamente; o jogo a lê na próxima inicialização."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada alteração é guardada imediatamente; o jogo a lê na próxima inicialização."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Каждое изменение сохраняется сразу; игра читает их при запуске."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svaka promena se čuva odjednom; igra ih čita kada počne."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Varje ändring sparas direkt; spelet läser in inställningarna när det startar."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกการเปลี่ยนแปลงจะถูกบันทึกทันทีและเกมจะอ่านเมื่อเริ่ม"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agad na sine-save ang bawat pagbabago at binabasa ng laro sa pagsisimula."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her değişiklik anında kaydedilir; oyun bunları başlarken okur."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожна зміна зберігається одразу; гра читає їх під час запуску."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi thay đổi được lưu ngay và trò chơi sẽ đọc khi bắt đầu."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有更改会立即保存;游戏在启动时读取它们。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有更改會即時儲存，遊戲啟動時會自動讀取。"}}}},
    "Every frame (smoothest)": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожны кадр (найплаўней)"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada fotograma (el més fluid)"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Každý snímek (nejplynulejší)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jedes Bild (am flüssigsten)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada fotograma (lo más fluido)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"À chaque image (le plus fluide)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हर फ़्रेम (सबसे स्मूद)"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minden képkocka (a legsimább)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setiap frame (paling mulus)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ogni fotogramma (il più fluido)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"毎フレーム(最も滑らか)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყოველ კადრზე (ყველაზე გლუვი)"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Әр кадр (ең бірқалыпты)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"매 프레임 (가장 부드러움)"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setiap bingkai (paling lancar)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elk frame (vloeiendst)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Każda klatka (najpłynniej)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A cada quadro (mais fluido)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A cada fotograma (mais fluido)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Каждый кадр (плавнее всего)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svaki kadar (najglatkiji)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Varje bildruta (jämnast)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกเฟรม (ลื่นที่สุด)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bawat frame (pinakamakinis)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her kare (en akıcı)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожен кадр (найплавніше)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mỗi khung hình (mượt nhất)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每帧（最流畅）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每幀更新（最流暢）"}}}},
    "Every key goes back to OMSI 2's own keyboard.cfg. Keys you added for a bus's own triggers are removed.": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Totes les tecles tornen a la configuració original del keyboard.cfg d'OMSI 2. Se suprimeixen les tecles que has afegit per als esdeveniments propis d'un autobús."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alle Tasten kehren zur keyboard.cfg von OMSI 2 zurück. Für Bus-eigene Trigger hinzugefügte Tasten werden entfernt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas las teclas vuelven al keyboard.cfg original de OMSI 2. Se eliminan las que hayas añadido para los eventos propios de un autobús."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toutes les touches reviennent au keyboard.cfg d'OMSI 2. Les touches ajoutées pour les déclencheurs propres à un bus sont supprimées."}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყველა კლავიში უბრუნდება OMSI 2-ის საკუთარ keyboard.cfg-ს. ავტობუსის საკუთარი ტრიგერებისთვის დამატებული კლავიშები წაიშლება."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as teclas voltam ao keyboard.cfg original do OMSI 2. As teclas que você adicionou para eventos próprios de um ônibus são removidas."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as teclas voltam ao keyboard.cfg do próprio OMSI 2. As teclas que adicionou para os eventos próprios de um autocarro são removidas."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Все клавиши вернутся к keyboard.cfg из OMSI 2. Клавиши, добавленные для триггеров автобусов, будут удалены."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svaki taster se vraća na sopstvenu tastaturu OMSI 2.cfg. Ključevi koje ste dodali za sopstvene okidače magistrale se uklanjaju."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alla tangenter återställs till OMSI 2:s egen keyboard.cfg. Tangenter du lagt till för bussens egna skripthändelser tas bort."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有按鍵將恢復為 OMSI 2 的 keyboard.cfg 設定。為巴士觸發事件新增的按鍵會被移除。"}}}},
    "Every setting is back to how it came.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе налады вернуты да пачатковых."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tots els ajustos han tornat als valors originals."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Všechna nastavení jsou zpět do původního stavu."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alle Einstellungen sind wieder auf dem Ausgangszustand."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todos los ajustes vuelven a como venían."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tous les réglages ont été réinitialisés."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सभी सेटिंग्स पहले जैसी हो गईं।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minden beállítás visszaállt az eredetire."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutte le impostazioni sono tornate come all'origine."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべての設定を初期状態に戻しました。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყველა პარამეტრი საწყის მდგომარეობას დაუბრუნდა."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Барлық баптаулар бастапқы күйіне қайтарылды."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alle instellingen zijn teruggezet naar de oorspronkelijke waarden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystkie ustawienia przywrócono do stanu początkowego."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as configurações voltaram ao original."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as definições voltaram ao original."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Все настройки возвращены к исходным."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svaka postavka se vraća onakva kakva je bila."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alla inställningar har återställts till sina ursprungliga värden."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tüm ayarlar ilk haline döndü."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усі налаштування повернуто до початкових."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有设置已恢复为初始状态。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有設定已恢復為初始預設值。"}}}},
    "Every solid mesh": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожная суцэльная сетка"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Totes les malles sòlides"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Každá pevná síť"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jedes feste Mesh"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas las mallas sólidas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tous les maillages solides"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हर ठोस मेश"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minden tömör háló"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semua mesh padat"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ogni mesh solida"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべてのソリッドメッシュ"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყველა მყარი ბადე"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Әрбір қатты меш"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 솔리드 메시"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semua mesh pejal"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elke massieve mesh"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Każda bryła"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as malhas sólidas"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as malhas sólidas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Все твёрдые меши"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svaka čvrsta mreža"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alla solida modeller"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เมชทึบทั้งหมด"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bawat solid mesh"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her katı mesh"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожна суцільна сітка"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi lưới đặc"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有实体网格"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有實體模型網格"}}}},
    "Every space": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожнае месца"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Totes les places"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Každé místo"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jeder Platz"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas las plazas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toutes les places"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हर जगह"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minden hely"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semua tempat parkir"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ogni posto"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべての駐車スペース"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყველა ადგილი"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Әрбір орын"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 주차 공간"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setiap ruang parkir"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elke plek"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Każde miejsce"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as vagas"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todas as vagas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Все места"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svaki prostor"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Varje plats"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกช่องจอด"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lahat ng parking space"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her yer"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Кожне місце"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi chỗ đỗ"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有车位"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每個車位"}}}},
    "Everything the game keeps on the graphics card: textures, models and the picture itself. Automatic is nine tenths of the card.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усё, што гульня трымае на відэакарце: тэкстуры, мадэлі і сама карцінка. Аўтаматычна — дзевяць дзясятых памяці карты."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tot el que el joc guarda a la targeta gràfica: textures, models i la mateixa imatge. Automàtic són nou desenes parts de la targeta."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vše, co hra drží na grafické kartě: textury, modely a samotný obraz. Automaticky je to devět desetin karty."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles, was das Spiel auf der Grafikkarte hält: Texturen, Modelle und das Bild selbst. Automatisch sind neun Zehntel der Karte."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todo lo que el juego guarda en la tarjeta gráfica: texturas, modelos y la propia imagen. Automático son nueve décimas partes de la tarjeta."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout ce que le jeu garde sur la carte graphique : textures, modèles et l'image elle-même. Automatique : neuf dixièmes de la carte."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"गेम ग्राफ़िक्स कार्ड पर जो कुछ रखता है: टेक्सचर, मॉडल और स्वयं चित्र। स्वचालित कार्ड का दस में से नौ हिस्सा है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minden, amit a játék a videokártyán tart: textúrák, modellek és maga a kép. Automatikus: a kártya kilenctizede."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semua yang disimpan game di kartu grafis: tekstur, model, dan gambar itu sendiri. Otomatis adalah sembilan persepuluh kartu."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutto ciò che il gioco tiene sulla scheda grafica: texture, modelli e l'immagine stessa. Automatico è nove decimi della scheda."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ゲームがグラフィックカードに置くすべて：テクスチャ、モデル、画面そのもの。自動ではカードの10分の9です。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ყველაფერი, რასაც თამაში ვიდეობარათზე ინახავს: ტექსტურები, მოდელები და თავად გამოსახულება. ავტომატური ბარათის ცხრა მეათედია."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ойын бейнекартада ұстайтын барлығы: текстуралар, модельдер және суреттің өзі. Автоматты — карта жадының оннан тоғызы."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"게임이 그래픽 카드에 두는 모든 것: 텍스처, 모델, 화면 자체. 자동은 카드의 10분의 9입니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semua yang disimpan permainan pada kad grafik: tekstur, model dan gambar itu sendiri. Automatik ialah sembilan persepuluh kad."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles wat het spel op de videokaart houdt: textures, modellen en het beeld zelf. Automatisch is negen tiende van de kaart."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystko, co gra trzyma na karcie graficznej: tekstury, modele i sam obraz. Automatycznie to dziewięć dziesiątych karty."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo o que o jogo mantém na placa de vídeo: texturas, modelos e a própria imagem. Automático é nove décimos da placa."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo o que o jogo mantém na placa gráfica: texturas, modelos e a própria imagem. Automático é nove décimos da placa."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всё, что игра держит на видеокарте: текстуры, модели и сама картинка. Автоматически — девять десятых памяти карты."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sve što igra čuva u memoriji grafičke kartice: teksture, modeli i sama slika. Opcija „Automatski“ koristi 90% memorije kartice."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allt spelet håller på grafikkortet: texturer, modeller och själva bilden. Automatiskt är nio tiondelar av kortet."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกอย่างที่เกมเก็บไว้บนการ์ดจอ: พื้นผิว โมเดล และภาพเอง อัตโนมัติคือเก้าในสิบของการ์ด"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lahat ng itinatago ng laro sa graphics card: mga texture, mga modelo at ang larawan mismo. Ang Automatic ay siyam na ikasampu ng card."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oyunun ekran kartında tuttuğu her şey: dokular, modeller ve görüntünün kendisi. Otomatik, kartın onda dokuzudur."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе, що гра тримає на відеокарті: текстури, моделі й саме зображення. Автоматично — дев'ять десятих пам'яті карти."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi thứ trò chơi giữ trên card đồ họa: texture, mô hình và chính hình ảnh. Tự động là chín phần mười của card."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"游戏在显卡上保留的全部内容：纹理、模型和画面本身。自动为显卡的十分之九。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"遊戲在顯示卡上保留的一切：材質、模型與畫面本身。自動為顯示卡的十分之九。"}}}},
    "Export diagnostics": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporta el diagnòstic"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnosedaten exportieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportar diagnóstico"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporter les diagnostics"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"დიაგნოსტიკის ექსპორტი"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnostische gegevens exporteren"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportar diagnóstico"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportar diagnóstico"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Экспортировать диагностику"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eksport dijagnostika"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportera diagnostik"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"匯出診斷資料"}}}},
    "Eye above screen centre": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ull per sobre del centre de la pantalla"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auge über Bildschirmmitte"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ojos por encima del centro de la pantalla"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Œil au-dessus du centre de l'écran"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"თვალი ეკრანის ცენტრის ზემოთ"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oog boven het midden van het scherm"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Olhos acima do centro da tela"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Olhos acima do centro do ecrã"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Глаз выше центра экрана"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oko iznad centra ekrana"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ögat ovanför skärmens mitt"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"眼睛位于屏幕中心上方"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"眼睛位於螢幕中心上方"}}}},
    "Eye to centre screen": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ull a la pantalla central"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auge zum mittleren Bildschirm"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Distancia de los ojos a la pantalla central"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Distance de l'œil à l'écran central"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"თვალიდან ცენტრალურ ეკრანამდე"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oog tot het middelste scherm"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Olhos até a tela central"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Olhos até ao ecrã central"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Расстояние от глаза до центрального экрана"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oči u centar ekrana"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Öga till mittskärm"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"眼睛到中央屏幕的距离"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"眼睛到螢幕中央"}}}},
    "Female": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dona"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weiblich"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mujer"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Femme"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ქალი"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Feminino"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Feminino"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Женщина"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Žensko"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kvinna"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"女性"}}}},
    "Few (fastest)": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Мала (найхутчэй)"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pocs (el més ràpid)"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Málo (nejrychlejší)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wenige (am schnellsten)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pocos (el más rápido)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Peu (le plus rapide)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"बहुत कम (सबसे तेज़)"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kevés (leggyorsabb)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paling sedikit (tercepat)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pochi (velocissimo)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"少ない(最速)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ცოტა (ყველაზე სწრაფი)"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Аз (ең жылдам)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"최소 (가장 빠름)"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paling sedikit (terpantas)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weinig (snelst)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mało (najszybciej)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Poucos (o mais rápido)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Poucos (o mais rápido)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Мало (быстрее всего)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nekoliko (najbrži)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Få (snabbast)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"น้อยที่สุด (เร็วที่สุด)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pinakakaunti (pinakamabilis)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Az (en hızlı)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Мало (найшвидше)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ít nhất (nhanh nhất)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"很少(最快)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最少（最快）"}}}},
    "Fewer (faster)": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Менш (хутчэй)"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menys (més ràpid)"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Méně (rychlejší)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weniger (schneller)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menos (más rápido)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moins (plus rapide)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कम (तेज़)"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kevesebb (gyorsabb)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lebih sedikit (lebih cepat)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Meno (più veloce)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"少なめ(高速)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ნაკლები (უფრო სწრაფი)"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Азырақ (жылдамырақ)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"적게 (더 빠름)"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kurang (lebih pantas)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minder (sneller)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mniej (szybciej)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menos (mais rápido)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menos (mais rápido)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Меньше (быстрее)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manje (brže)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Färre (snabbare)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"น้อยลง (เร็วขึ้น)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mas kaunti (mas mabilis)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Daha az (daha hızlı)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Менше (швидше)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ít hơn (nhanh hơn)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"较少(更快)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"較少（更快）"}}}},
    "Field of view": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поле зроку"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Camp de visió"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zorný úhel"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sichtfeld"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Campo de visión"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Champ de vision"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"फ़ील्ड ऑफ़ व्यू"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Látómező"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Campo visivo"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"視野角"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ხედვის ველი"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Көру өрісі"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gezichtsveld"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pole widzenia"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Campo de visão"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Campo de visão"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Угол обзора"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vidno polje"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Synfält"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Görüş alanı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поле зору"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"视野"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"視野角度 (FOV)"}}}},
    "Filter lines...": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пошук лініі..."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtra línies..."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtrovat linky..."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Linien filtern..."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtrar líneas..."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtrer les lignes..."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"लाइनें छाँटें..."}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Járatok szűrése..."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saring jalur..."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtra linee..."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統を絞り込む..."}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ხაზების ფილტრი..."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Желілерді сүзу..."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"노선 검색..."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tapis laluan..."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lijnen filteren..."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtruj linie..."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtrar linhas..."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtrar linhas..."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поиск линии..."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtriraj linije..."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filtrera linjer..."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"กรองสายรถ..."}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I-filter ang mga linya..."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hatları filtrele..."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пошук лінії..."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lọc tuyến..."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"筛选线路..."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"篩選路線..."}}}},
