    "Heavy: can cost many frames per second on most graphics cards": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Рэсурсаёмка: на большасці відэакарт можа моцна знізіць частату кадраў"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exigent: pot costar molts fotogrames per segon a la majoria de targetes gràfiques"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Náročné: na většině grafických karet může stát hodně snímků za sekundu"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aufwendig: kann auf den meisten Grafikkarten viele Bilder pro Sekunde kosten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exigente: puede costar muchos fotogramas por segundo en la mayoría de tarjetas gráficas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lourd : peut coûter beaucoup d'images par seconde sur la plupart des cartes graphiques"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"भारी: अधिकांश ग्राफ़िक्स कार्ड पर यह कई फ़्रेम प्रति सेकंड घटा सकता है"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erőforrásigényes: a legtöbb videokártyán jelentősen csökkentheti a képkockasebességet"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Berat: dapat mengurangi banyak frame per detik di sebagian besar kartu grafis"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pesante: può costare molti fotogrammi al secondo sulla maggior parte delle schede grafiche"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重い：多くのグラフィックカードでフレームレートが大きく下がることがあります"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მძიმე: ვიდეობარათების უმეტესობაზე შეიძლება წამში ბევრი კადრი დაკარგოთ"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ауыр: көптеген бейнекарталарда секундына көп кадр жоғалтуы мүмкін"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"무거움: 대부분의 그래픽 카드에서 초당 프레임이 크게 떨어질 수 있습니다"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Berat: boleh mengurangkan banyak bingkai sesaat pada kebanyakan kad grafik"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zwaar: kan op de meeste videokaarten veel beelden per seconde kosten"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wymagające: na większości kart graficznych może kosztować wiele klatek na sekundę"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pesado: pode custar muitos quadros por segundo na maioria das placas de vídeo"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pesado: pode custar muitos fotogramas por segundo na maioria das placas gráficas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ресурсоёмко: на большинстве видеокарт может сильно снизить частоту кадров"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zahtevno: na većini grafičkih kartica može da odnese mnogo kadrova u sekundi"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tungt: kan kosta många bilder per sekund på de flesta grafikkort"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"หนัก: อาจทำให้เฟรมต่อวินาทีลดลงมากบนการ์ดจอส่วนใหญ่"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mabigat: maaaring magbawas ng maraming frame bawat segundo sa karamihan ng graphics card"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ağır: çoğu ekran kartında saniyede çok kare kaybettirebilir"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ресурсоємно: на більшості відеокарт може сильно знизити частоту кадрів"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nặng: có thể làm mất nhiều khung hình mỗi giây trên hầu hết card đồ họa"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开销大：在大多数显卡上可能大幅降低每秒帧数"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"負擔大：在多數顯示卡上可能大幅降低每秒幀數"}}}},
    "Hide log": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схаваць журнал"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Amaga el registre"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skrýt log"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protokoll ausblenden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ocultar registro"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masquer les logs"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"लॉग छिपाएँ"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Napló elrejtése"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sembunyikan log"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nascondi log"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ログを隠す"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ჟურნალის დამალვა"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Журналды жасыру"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"로그 숨기기"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sembunyikan log"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Log verbergen"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ukryj dziennik"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ocultar log"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ocultar log"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скрыть журнал"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sakrij dnevnik"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dölj logg"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ซ่อนบันทึก"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Itago ang log"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Günlüğü gizle"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сховати журнал"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ẩn nhật ký"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隐藏日志"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隱藏日誌"}}}},
    "Hide the command line": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схаваць камандны радок"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Amaga la línia d'ordres"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skrýt příkazový řádek"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Befehlszeile ausblenden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ocultar la línea de comandos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Masquer la ligne de commande"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कमांड लाइन छिपाएँ"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Parancssor elrejtése"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sembunyikan baris perintah"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nascondi la riga di comando"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コマンドラインを隠す"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ბრძანების ხაზის დამალვა"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пәрмен жолын жасыру"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"명령줄 숨기기"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sembunyikan baris arahan"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Opdrachtregel verbergen"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ukryj wiersz poleceń"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ocultar a linha de comando"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ocultar a linha de comandos"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Скрыть командную строку"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sakrij komandnu liniju"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dölj kommandoraden"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ซ่อนบรรทัดคำสั่ง"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Itago ang command line"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Komut satırını gizle"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сховати ком