    "High (512)": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Высокая (512)"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta (512)"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vysoká (512)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoch (512)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alto (512)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Élevé (512)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हाई (512)"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Magas (512)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tinggi (512)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta (512)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高(512)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მაღალი (512)"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Жоғары (512)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"높음 (512)"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tinggi (512)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoog (512)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wysoka (512)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alto (512)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alto (512)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Высокое (512)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"visoko (512)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hög (512)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"สูง (512)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mataas (512)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yüksek (512)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Висока (512)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cao (512)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高(512)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高（512）"}}}},
    "High beam": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дальняе святло"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Llums de carretera"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dálková světla"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fernlicht"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Luces largas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Feux de route"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हाई बीम"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Távolsági fényszóró"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lampu jauh"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abbaglianti"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ハイビーム"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"შორი შუქი"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Алыс жарық"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"상향등"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lampu tinggi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Grootlicht"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Światła drogowe"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Farol alto"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Farol alto"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дальний свет"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Duga svetla"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Helljus"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ไฟสูง"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"High beam"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uzun far"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дальнє світло"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đèn pha xa"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"远光灯"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高燈"}}}},
    "High quality (improved)": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Высокая якасць (палепшаныя)"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualitat (millorats)"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vysoká kvalita (vylepšené)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hohe Qualität (verbessert)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta calidad (mejorados)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Haute qualité (améliorés)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"उच्च गुणवत्ता (उन्नत)"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Magas minőség (javított)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kualitas tinggi (ditingkatkan)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualità (migliorati)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高品質（改良版）"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მაღალი ხარისხი (გაუმჯობესებული)"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Жоғары сапа (жақсартылған)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"고품질 (개선됨)"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kualiti tinggi (dipertingkat)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoge kwaliteit (verbeterd)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wysoka jakość (ulepszone)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualidade (aprimorados)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualidade (melhorados)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Высокое качество (улучшенные)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Visok kvalitet (poboljšano)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hög kvalitet (förbättrade)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คุณภาพสูง (ปรับปรุงแล้ว)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mataas na kalidad (pinahusay)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yüksek kalite (geliştirilmiş)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Висока якість (покращені)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chất lượng cao (cải tiến)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高质量（改进）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高品質（改進）"}}}},
    "High quality draws the people with the Microsoft Rocketbox avatars and their living faces, on this computer only: servers and other players keep their own. They are downloaded once (about 310 MB).": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Высокая якасць малюе людзей аватарамі Microsoft Rocketbox з жывой мімікай — толькі на гэтым камп'ютары: серверы і іншыя гульцы бачаць сваіх. Спампоўваюцца адзін раз (каля 310 МБ)."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualitat dibuixa les persones amb els avatars Microsoft Rocketbox i les seves cares vives, només en aquest ordinador: els servidors i els altres jugadors mantenen els seus. Es baixen una vegada (uns 310 MB)."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vysoká kvalita kreslí lidi avatary Microsoft Rocketbox s živou mimikou, jen na tomto počítači: servery a ostatní hráči si ponechají své. Stahují se jednou (asi 310 MB)."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hohe Qualität zeichnet die Menschen mit den Microsoft-Rocketbox-Avataren und ihren lebendigen Gesichtern, nur auf diesem Computer: Server und andere Spieler behalten ihre eigenen. Sie werden einmal heruntergeladen (etwa 310 MB)."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta calidad dibuja a las personas con los avatares Microsoft Rocketbox y sus caras vivas, solo en este ordenador: los servidores y los demás jugadores conservan los suyos. Se descargan una vez (unos 310 MB)."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Haute qualité dessine les personnes avec les avatars Microsoft Rocketbox et leurs visages vivants, sur cet ordinateur seulement : les serveurs et les autres joueurs gardent les leurs. Ils sont téléchargés une fois (environ 310 Mo)."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"उच्च गुणवत्ता लोगों को Microsoft Rocketbox अवतारों और उनके जीवंत चेहरों के साथ केवल इस कंप्यूटर पर दिखाती है: सर्वर और अन्य खिलाड़ी अपने ही रखते हैं। ये एक बार डाउनलोड होते हैं (लगभग 310 MB)।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A magas minőség a Microsoft Rocketbox avatarokkal és élő arcukkal rajzolja az embereket, csak ezen a gépen: a szerverek és a többi játékos a sajátjukat látják. Egyszer töltődnek le (kb. 310 MB)."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kualitas tinggi menggambar orang dengan avatar Microsoft Rocketbox dan wajah yang hidup, hanya di komputer ini: server dan pemain lain tetap memakai milik mereka. Diunduh sekali (sekitar 310 MB)."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualità disegna le persone con gli avatar Microsoft Rocketbox e i loro volti vivi, solo su questo computer: server e altri giocatori mantengono i propri. Vengono scaricati una volta (circa 310 MB)."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高品質では人物をMicrosoft Rocketboxのアバターと豊かな表情で描きます（このコンピューターのみ。サーバーや他のプレイヤーには影響しません）。一度だけダウンロードされます（約310 MB）。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მაღალი ხარისხი ადამიანებს ხატავს Microsoft Rocketbox-ის ავატარებითა და ცოცხალი სახეებით, მხოლოდ ამ კომპიუტერზე: სერვერები და სხვა მოთამაშეები საკუთარს ინარჩუნებენ. ერთხელ ჩამოიტვირთება (დაახლოებით 310 MB)."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Жоғары сапа адамдарды Microsoft Rocketbox аватарларымен және тірі мимикамен тек осы компьютерде салады: серверлер мен басқа ойыншылар өздерінікін көреді. Бір рет жүктеледі (шамамен 310 МБ)."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"고품질은 사람들을 Microsoft Rocketbox 아바타와 생생한 얼굴로 이 컴퓨터에서만 그립니다. 서버와 다른 플레이어는 자신의 모델을 유지합니다. 한 번만 내려받습니다(약 310MB)."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kualiti tinggi melukis orang dengan avatar Microsoft Rocketbox dan wajah yang hidup, hanya di komputer ini: pelayan dan pemain lain kekal dengan milik mereka. Dimuat turun sekali (kira-kira 310 MB)."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoge kwaliteit tekent de mensen met de Microsoft Rocketbox-avatars en hun levendige gezichten, alleen op deze computer: servers en andere spelers houden hun eigen. Ze worden één keer gedownload (ongeveer 310 MB)."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wysoka jakość rysuje ludzi awatarami Microsoft Rocketbox z żywą mimiką, tylko na tym komputerze: serwery i inni gracze zachowują swoje. Pobierane raz (około 310 MB)."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualidade desenha as pessoas com os avatares Microsoft Rocketbox e seus rostos vivos, só neste computador: servidores e outros jogadores mantêm os seus. São baixados uma vez (cerca de 310 MB)."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alta qualidade desenha as pessoas com os avatares Microsoft Rocketbox e os seus rostos vivos, só neste computador: os servidores e os outros jogadores mantêm os seus. São transferidos uma vez (cerca de 310 MB)."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Высокое качество рисует людей аватарами Microsoft Rocketbox с живой мимикой — только на этом компьютере: у серверов и других игроков остаются свои. Скачиваются один раз (около 310 МБ)."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Visok kvalitet privlači ljude sa Microsoft Rocketbok avatarima i njihovim živim licima, samo na ovom računaru: serveri i drugi igrači drže svoje. One se preuzimaju jednom (oko 310 MB)."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hög kvalitet ritar människorna med Microsoft Rocketbox-avatarerna och deras levande ansikten, bara på den här datorn: servrar och andra spelare behåller sina egna. De laddas ner en gång (cirka 310 MB)."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คุณภาพสูงจะวาดผู้คนด้วยอวตาร Microsoft Rocketbox และสีหน้าที่มีชีวิต เฉพาะบนคอมพิวเตอร์นี้เท่านั้น เซิร์ฟเวอร์และผู้เล่นอื่นยังคงเห็นของตนเอง ดาวน์โหลดครั้งเดียว (ประมาณ 310 MB)"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Iginuguhit ng mataas na kalidad ang mga tao gamit ang mga avatar ng Microsoft Rocketbox at ang kanilang buhay na mukha, sa computer na ito lamang: ang mga server at ibang manlalaro ay may kani-kanilang sarili. Isang beses itong dina-download (mga 310 MB)."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yüksek kalite, insanları Microsoft Rocketbox avatarları ve canlı yüzleriyle yalnızca bu bilgisayarda çizer: sunucular ve diğer oyuncular kendilerininkini görür. Bir kez indirilir (yaklaşık 310 MB)."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Висока якість малює людей аватарами Microsoft Rocketbox з живою мімікою — лише на цьому комп'ютері: сервери та інші гравці бачать своїх. Завантажуються один раз (близько 310 МБ)."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chất lượng cao vẽ con người bằng các avatar Microsoft Rocketbox với gương mặt sống động, chỉ trên máy tính này: máy chủ và người chơi khác giữ mô hình của họ. Chỉ tải một lần (khoảng 310 MB)."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高质量使用 Microsoft Rocketbox 头像和生动的面部表情绘制人物，仅限本机：服务器和其他玩家保留各自的模型。只需下载一次（约 310 MB）。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高品質使用 Microsoft Rocketbox 頭像與生動的臉部表情繪製人物，僅限本機：伺服器和其他玩家保留各自的模型。只需下載一次（約 310 MB）。"}}}},
    "Hold Shift, Ctrl or Alt for a combination, or press one alone to bind it. Escape cancels; Backspace or Delete clears the key.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Утрымлівайце Shift, Ctrl або Alt для спалучэння або націсніце адну з іх асобна, каб прызначыць яе. Escape: адмена; Backspace або Delete ачышчаюць клавішу."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén Maj, Ctrl o Alt per a una combinació, o prem-ne una sola per assignar-la. Escape cancel·la; Retrocés o Supr esborra la tecla."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Podržte Shift, Ctrl nebo Alt pro kombinaci, nebo jeden z nich stiskněte samotný, abyste ho přiřadili. Escape zruší; Backspace nebo Delete klávesu vymaže."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Halte Umschalt, Strg oder Alt für eine Kombination, oder drücke eine davon allein, um sie zu belegen. Esc bricht ab; Rücktaste oder Entf löscht die Taste."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén Mayús, Ctrl o Alt para una combinación, o pulsa una sola para asignarla. Escape cancela; Retroceso o Supr borra la tecla."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maintenez Maj, Ctrl ou Alt pour une combinaison, ou appuyez sur l'une d'elles seule pour l'attribuer. Échap annule ; Retour arrière ou Suppr efface la touche."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"संयोजन के लिए Shift, Ctrl या Alt दबाए रखें, या किसी एक को अकेले दबाकर उसे ही असाइन करें। Escape रद्द करता है; Backspace या Delete कुंजी हटाता है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tartsd lenyomva a Shift, Ctrl vagy Alt billentyűt egy kombinációhoz, vagy nyomd meg egyedül a hozzárendeléséhez. Az Escape megszakít; a Backspace vagy Delete törli a billentyűt."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tahan Shift, Ctrl, atau Alt untuk kombinasi, atau tekan salah satunya sendiri untuk menetapkannya. Escape membatalkan; Backspace atau Delete menghapus tombol."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tieni premuto Maiusc, Ctrl o Alt per una combinazione, oppure premine uno da solo per assegnarlo. Esc annulla; Backspace o Canc cancella il tasto."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"組み合わせには Shift、Ctrl、Alt を押したままにします。単独で押すとそのキー自体を割り当てます。Escape で取り消し、Backspace か Delete でキーを消去します。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კომბინაციისთვის დააჭირეთ და გეჭიროთ Shift, Ctrl ან Alt, ან მისანიჭებლად დააჭირეთ მხოლოდ ერთ მათგანს. Escape აუქმებს; Backspace ან Delete ასუფთავებს კლავიშს."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Тіркесім үшін Shift, Ctrl немесе Alt пернесін басып тұрыңыз немесе тағайындау үшін біреуін жалғыз басыңыз. Escape: бас тарту; Backspace немесе Delete пернені тазартады."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"조합하려면 Shift, Ctrl 또는 Alt를 누른 채로 두고, 그 키 자체를 지정하려면 하나만 누르세요. Escape는 취소, Backspace나 Delete는 키를 지웁니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tahan Shift, Ctrl atau Alt untuk gabungan, atau tekan salah satu sahaja untuk menetapkannya. Escape membatalkan; Backspace atau Delete mengosongkan kekunci."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Houd Shift, Ctrl of Alt ingedrukt voor een combinatie, of druk er één los in om die toe te wijzen. Escape annuleert; Backspace of Delete wist de toets."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Przytrzymaj Shift, Ctrl lub Alt, aby utworzyć kombinację, albo naciśnij jeden z nich osobno, aby go przypisać. Escape anuluje; Backspace lub Delete czyści klawisz."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Segure Shift, Ctrl ou Alt para uma combinação, ou pressione uma delas sozinha para atribuí-la. Escape cancela; Backspace ou Delete limpa a tecla."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantenha Shift, Ctrl ou Alt para uma combinação, ou prima uma delas sozinha para a atribuir. Escape cancela; Backspace ou Delete limpa a tecla."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Удерживайте Shift, Ctrl или Alt для сочетания или нажмите одну из них отдельно, чтобы назначить её. Escape: отмена; Backspace или Delete очищают клавишу."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Držite Shift, Ctrl ili Alt za kombinaciju ili pritisnite samo jedan taster da biste ga dodelili. Esc otkazuje; Backspace ili Delete briše taster."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Håll Shift, Ctrl eller Alt för en kombination, eller tryck en av dem ensam för att binda den. Escape avbryter; Backsteg eller Delete rensar tangenten."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"กด Shift, Ctrl หรือ Alt ค้างไว้เพื่อใช้ปุ่มผสม หรือกดปุ่มใดปุ่มหนึ่งเดี่ยว ๆ เพื่อกำหนดปุ่มนั้น Escape ยกเลิก; Backspace หรือ Delete ล้างปุ่ม"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I-hold ang Shift, Ctrl o Alt para sa kombinasyon, o pindutin ang isa nang mag-isa para i-bind ito. Kinakansela ng Escape; binubura ng Backspace o Delete ang key."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bir kombinasyon için Shift, Ctrl veya Alt tuşunu basılı tutun ya da atamak için birine tek başına basın. Escape iptal eder; Backspace veya Delete tuşu temizler."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Утримуйте Shift, Ctrl або Alt для поєднання або натисніть одну з них окремо, щоб призначити її. Escape: скасувати; Backspace або Delete очищають клавішу."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Giữ Shift, Ctrl hoặc Alt để tạo tổ hợp, hoặc nhấn riêng một phím để gán chính nó. Escape để hủy; Backspace hoặc Delete xóa phím."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住 Shift、Ctrl 或 Alt 组合按键，或单独按下其中一个来绑定它。Escape 取消；Backspace 或 Delete 清除按键。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住 Shift、Ctrl 或 Alt 以組合按鍵，或單獨按下其中一個來綁定它。Escape 取消；Backspace 或 Delete 清除按鍵。"}}}},
    "Hold the cursor while the mouse steers (off: the crosshair stays free, the window's edges are the lock)": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retén el cursor mentre dirigeixes amb el ratolí (desactivat: la creu queda lliure i els límits de la finestra fan de topall)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cursor beim Lenken mit der Maus festhalten (aus: das Fadenkreuz bleibt frei, die Fensterränder sind der Anschlag)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retener el cursor al dirigir con el ratón (desactivado: la cruceta queda libre y los bordes de la ventana limitan el giro)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retenir le curseur pendant la direction à la souris (désactivé : le viseur reste libre, les bords de la fenêtre font la butée)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"კურსორის დაკავება მაუსით მართვისას (გამორთული: სამიზნე თავისუფალია, ფანჯრის კიდეები ზღვარია)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prender o cursor enquanto o mouse esterça (desligado: a mira fica livre e as bordas da janela são o batente)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prender o cursor enquanto o rato controla a direção (desativado: a mira fica livre, as bordas da janela são o batente)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Удерживать курсор при рулении мышью (выкл.: перекрестие свободно, края окна служат упором)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Držite kursor dok miš upravlja (isključeno: krstić ostaje slobodan, ivice prozora su brava)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Håll markören medan musen styr (av: hårkorset är fritt, fönstrets kanter är ändlägena)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"滑鼠轉向時鎖定游標（關閉時準星可自由移動，視窗邊緣為轉向極限）"}}}},
    "Hold the nearby (V) or radio (B) key to talk. The microphone is used only while a key is held; nothing is recorded": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén la tecla de proximitat (V) o de ràdio (B) per parlar. El micròfon només s'usa mentre es manté una tecla; no s'enregistra res"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Halte die Nähe-Taste (V) oder Funk-Taste (B) zum Sprechen. Das Mikrofon wird nur benutzt, solange eine Taste gehalten wird; es wird nichts aufgezeichnet"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén la tecla de cercanía (V) o de radio (B) para hablar. El micrófono solo se usa mientras se mantiene una tecla; no se graba nada"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maintenez la touche proximité (V) ou radio (B) pour parler. Le microphone n'est utilisé que tant qu'une touche est maintenue ; rien n'est enregistré"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"近く（V）または無線（B）キーを押している間だけ話せます。マイクはキーを押している間のみ使用され、録音はされません"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"სასაუბროდ დააჭირეთ და გეჭიროთ ახლომდებარეთა (V) ან რადიოს (B) კლავიში. მიკროფონი მხოლოდ კლავიშის დაჭერისას გამოიყენება; არაფერი იწერება"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"근처(V) 또는 무전(B) 키를 누르고 있는 동안 말합니다. 마이크는 키를 누르는 동안에만 사용되며 아무것도 녹음되지 않습니다"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Przytrzymaj klawisz bliskości (V) lub radia (B), aby mówić. Mikrofon działa tylko przy wciśniętym klawiszu; nic nie jest nagrywane"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Segure a tecla de proximidade (V) ou de rádio (B) para falar. O microfone só é usado enquanto uma tecla está pressionada; nada é gravado"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantenha premida a tecla de proximidade (V) ou de rádio (B) para falar. O microfone só é usado enquanto uma tecla está premida; nada é gravado"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Удерживайте клавишу «рядом» (V) или «радио» (B), чтобы говорить. Микрофон работает только пока нажата клавиша; ничего не записывается"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Утримуйте клавішу «поруч» (V) або «радіо» (B), щоб говорити. Мікрофон працює лише поки натиснута клавіша; нічого не записується"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住附近（V）或无线电（B）键说话。仅在按住按键时使用麦克风，不会录音"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住附近（V）或無線電（B）鍵說話。僅在按住按鍵時使用麥克風，不會錄音"}}}},
