    "Looking for OMSI 2: it is found by itself once the copy is done.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Шукаем OMSI 2: гульня знойдзецца сама, як толькі капіраванне скончыцца."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cercant OMSI 2: es trobarà sol quan acabi la còpia."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hledáme OMSI 2: hra se najde sama, jakmile kopírování skončí."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Suche nach OMSI 2: Es wird von selbst gefunden, sobald die Kopie fertig ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Buscando OMSI 2: se encontrará solo cuando termine la copia."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recherche d'OMSI 2 : il sera trouvé tout seul une fois la copie terminée."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 खोजा जा रहा है: कॉपी पूरी होते ही यह अपने आप मिल जाएगा।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Az OMSI 2 keresése: amint kész a másolás, magától előkerül."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mencari OMSI 2: akan ditemukan otomatis setelah penyalinan selesai."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ricerca di OMSI 2: verrà trovato da solo a copia terminata."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2を探しています。コピーが終わると自動で見つかります。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2-ის ძიება: კოპირების დასრულებისთანავე ის თავისით მოიძებნება."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 ізделуде: көшіру аяқталған соң ол өзі табылады."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2를 찾는 중입니다. 복사가 끝나면 자동으로 찾습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mencari OMSI 2: ia akan ditemui secara automatik sebaik sahaja penyalinan selesai."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zoeken naar OMSI 2: het wordt vanzelf gevonden zodra het kopiëren klaar is."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Szukamy OMSI 