    "Simple": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Просты"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simple"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jednoduchý"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einfach"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sencillo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simple"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सरल"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Egyszerű"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sederhana"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semplice"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シンプル"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მარტივი"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Қарапайым"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"간단"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mudah"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eenvoudig"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prosty"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simples"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simples"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Простой"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jednostavno"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enkelt"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"แบบง่าย"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simple"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Basit"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Простий"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đơn giản"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"简单"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"簡易"}}}},
    "Simple: the lens, the look and the frame. Advanced: a camera body - sensor size, P/A/S/M exposure with ISO and metering, white balance in kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing and 16-bit PNG.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Просты: аб'ектыў, стыль і рамка. Пашыраны: корпус камеры - памер матрыцы, экспазіцыя P/A/S/M з ISO і замерам, баланс белага ў кельвінах, тылт-шыфт, гістаграма, фокус-пікінг, брэкетынг і 16-бітны PNG."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simple: l'objectiu, l'aspecte i el marc. Avançat: un cos de càmera - mida del sensor, exposició P/A/S/M amb ISO i mesura, balanç de blancs en kelvin, basculament i descentrament, histograma, ressaltat del focus, horquillat i PNG de 16 bits."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jednoduchý: objektiv, vzhled a rámeček. Pokročilý: tělo fotoaparátu - velikost snímače, expozice P/A/S/M s ISO a měřením, vyvážení bílé v kelvinech, tilt-shift, histogram, zvýraznění ostrosti, bracketing a 16bitové PNG."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einfach: Objektiv, Look und Rahmen. Erweitert: ein Kameragehäuse - Sensorgröße, P/A/S/M-Belichtung mit ISO und Belichtungsmessung, Weißabgleich in Kelvin, Tilt-Shift, Histogramm, Fokus-Peaking, Belichtungsreihen und 16-Bit-PNG."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sencillo: el objetivo, el estilo y el marco. Avanzado: un cuerpo de cámara - tamaño del sensor, exposición P/A/S/M con ISO y medición, balance de blancos en kelvin, basculamiento y descentramiento, histograma, realce de enfoque, horquillado y PNG de 16 bits."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simple : l'objectif, le rendu et le cadre. Avancé : un boîtier - taille du capteur, exposition P/A/S/M avec ISO et mesure, balance des blancs en kelvins, bascule et décentrement, histogramme, focus peaking, bracketing et PNG 16 bits."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सरल: लेंस, लुक और फ़्रेम। एडवांस्ड: एक कैमरा बॉडी - सेंसर साइज़, ISO और मीटरिंग के साथ P/A/S/M एक्सपोज़र, केल्विन में व्हाइट बैलेंस, टिल्ट-शिफ़्ट, हिस्टोग्राम, फ़ोकस पीकिंग, ब्रैकेटिंग और 16-बिट PNG।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Egyszerű: objektív, megjelenés és keret. Haladó: egy fényképezőgépváz - érzékelőméret, P/A/S/M expozíció ISO-val és fényméréssel, fehéregyensúly kelvinben, tilt-shift, hisztogram, fókuszkiemelés, expozíciós sorozat és 16 bites PNG."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sederhana: lensa, tampilan, dan bingkai. Lanjutan: bodi kamera - ukuran sensor, eksposur P/A/S/M dengan ISO dan pengukuran cahaya, white balance dalam kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing, dan PNG 16-bit."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semplice: l'obiettivo, lo stile e la cornice. Avanzato: un corpo macchina - dimensione del sensore, esposizione P/A/S/M con ISO e misurazione, bilanciamento del bianco in kelvin, basculaggio e decentramento, istogramma, focus peaking, bracketing e PNG a 16 bit."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シンプル：レンズ、仕上がり、フレーム。詳細：カメラボディ - センサーサイズ、ISOと測光を含むP/A/S/M露出、ケルビン指定のホワイトバランス、ティルト・シフト、ヒストグラム、ピーキング、ブラケティング、16ビットPNG。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მარტივი: ობიექტივი, სტილი და ჩარჩო. გაფართოებული: კამერის კორპუსი - სენსორის ზომა, P/A/S/M ექსპოზიცია ISO-თი და გაზომვით, თეთრის ბალანსი კელვინებში, tilt-shift, ჰისტოგრამა, ფოკუსის პიკინგი, ბრეკეტინგი და 16-ბიტიანი PNG."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Қарапайым: объектив, стиль және жиек. Кеңейтілген: камера корпусы - матрица өлшемі, ISO және өлшеуі бар P/A/S/M экспозициясы, кельвинмен ақ түс балансы, тилт-шифт, гистограмма, фокус-пикинг, брекетинг және 16 биттік PNG."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"간단: 렌즈, 룩, 프레임. 고급: 카메라 바디 - 센서 크기, ISO와 측광을 포함한 P/A/S/M 노출, 켈빈 단위 화이트 밸런스, 틸트-시프트, 히스토그램, 포커스 피킹, 브라케팅, 16비트 PNG."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mudah: kanta, gaya dan bingkai. Lanjutan: badan kamera - saiz sensor, dedahan P/A/S/M dengan ISO dan pemeteran, imbangan putih dalam kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing dan PNG 16-bit."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eenvoudig: het objectief, de look en de lijst. Geavanceerd: een camerabody - sensorformaat, P/A/S/M-belichting met ISO en lichtmeting, witbalans in kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing en 16-bits PNG."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prosty: obiektyw, wygląd i ramka. Zaawansowany: korpus aparatu - rozmiar matrycy, ekspozycja P/A/S/M z ISO i pomiarem światła, balans bieli w kelwinach, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing i 16-bitowy PNG."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simples: a lente, o visual e a moldura. Avançado: um corpo de câmera - tamanho do sensor, exposição P/A/S/M com ISO e medição, balanço de branco em kelvin, tilt-shift, histograma, focus peaking, bracketing e PNG de 16 bits."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simples: a objetiva, o aspeto e a moldura. Avançado: um corpo de câmara - tamanho do sensor, exposição P/A/S/M com ISO e medição, equilíbrio de brancos em kelvin, tilt-shift, histograma, focus peaking, bracketing e PNG de 16 bits."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Простой: объектив, стиль и рамка. Расширенный: корпус камеры - размер матрицы, экспозиция P/A/S/M с ISO и замером, баланс белого в кельвинах, тилт-шифт, гистограмма, фокус-пикинг, брекетинг и 16-битный PNG."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jednostavno: sočivo, izgled i okvir. Napredno: telo kamere - veličina senzora, P/A/S/M ekspozicija sa ISO i merenjem, balans belog u kelvinima, pomeranje nagiba, histogram, izoštravanje fokusa, bracketing i 16-bitni PNG."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enkelt: objektivet, utseendet och ramen. Avancerat: ett kamerahus - sensorstorlek, P/A/S/M-exponering med ISO och ljusmätning, vitbalans i kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, fokusmarkering, gaffling och 16-bitars PNG."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"แบบง่าย: เลนส์ โทนภาพ และกรอบ ขั้นสูง: บอดี้กล้อง - ขนาดเซ็นเซอร์ การรับแสง P/A/S/M พร้อม ISO และการวัดแสง สมดุลแสงขาวเป็นเคลวิน ทิลท์-ชิฟต์ ฮิสโตแกรม โฟกัสพีคกิ้ง ถ่ายคร่อม และ PNG 16 บิต"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simple: ang lens, ang itsura at ang frame. Advanced: isang camera body - laki ng sensor, P/A/S/M exposure na may ISO at metering, white balance sa kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing at 16-bit PNG."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Basit: objektif, görünüm ve çerçeve. Gelişmiş: bir makine gövdesi - sensör boyutu, ISO ve ölçümle P/A/S/M pozlama, kelvin cinsinden beyaz dengesi, tilt-shift, histogram, odak vurgulama, basamaklama ve 16 bit PNG."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Простий: об'єктив, стиль і рамка. Розширений: корпус камери - розмір матриці, експозиція P/A/S/M з ISO і вимірюванням, баланс білого в кельвінах, тілт-шифт, гістограма, фокус-пікінг, брекетинг і 16-бітний PNG."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đơn giản: ống kính, phong cách và khung. Nâng cao: một thân máy - kích thước cảm biến, phơi sáng P/A/S/M với ISO và đo sáng, cân bằng trắng theo kelvin, tilt-shift, histogram, focus peaking, bracketing và PNG 16 bit."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"简单：镜头、风格和边框。高级：一台相机机身 - 传感器尺寸、含 ISO 和测光的 P/A/S/M 曝光、以开尔文设定的白平衡、移轴、直方图、峰值对焦、包围曝光和 16 位 PNG。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"簡易：鏡頭、風格與邊框。進階：一台相機機身 - 感光元件尺寸、含 ISO 與測光的 P/A/S/M 曝光、以克氏溫度設定的白平衡、移軸、色階分佈圖、峰值對焦、包圍曝光與 16 位元 PNG。"}}}},
    "Simulation": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сімуляцыя"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulació"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulace"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulation"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulación"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulation"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सिमुलेशन"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Szimuláció"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulasi"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulazione"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シミュレーション"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"სიმულაცია"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Симуляция"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시뮬레이션"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulasi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulatie"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Symulacja"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulação"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulação"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Симуляция"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulacija"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulering"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การจำลอง"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulation"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simülasyon"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Симуляція"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mô phỏng"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模拟"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模擬"}}}},
    "Simulation on its own thread": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сімуляцыя ў асобным патоку"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulació en un fil propi"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulace ve vlastním vlákně"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulation in eigenem Thread"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulación en un hilo propio"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulation sur son propre thread"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सिमुलेशन अपने अलग थ्रेड पर"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Szimuláció saját szálon"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulasi di thread sendiri"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulazione su un thread separato"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シミュレーションを別スレッドで"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"სიმულაცია საკუთარ ნაკადზე"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Симуляция жеке ағында"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시뮬레이션을 별도 스레드에서"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulasi pada bebenang sendiri"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulatie in een eigen thread"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Symulacja we własnym wątku"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulação em uma thread própria"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulação numa thread própria"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Симуляция в отдельном потоке"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulacija u zasebnoj niti"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulering i en egen tråd"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การจำลองบนเธรดของตัวเอง"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simulasyon sa sarili nitong thread"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Simülasyon kendi iş parçacığında"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Симуляція в окремому потоці"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mô phỏng trên luồng riêng"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模拟使用独立线程"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模擬使用獨立執行緒"}}}},
    "Small objects": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дробныя аб'екты"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objectes petits"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Malé objekty"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kleine Objekte"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objetos pequeños"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Petits objets"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"छोटे ऑब्जेक्ट"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kis objektumok"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objek kecil"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oggetti piccoli"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"小さなオブジェクト"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"პატარა ობიექტები"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ұсақ нысандар"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작은 오브젝트"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objek kecil"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kleine objecten"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Małe obiekty"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objetos pequenos"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objetos pequenos"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Мелкие объекты"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mali predmeti"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Små objekt"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"วัตถุขนาดเล็ก"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maliliit na object"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Küçük nesneler"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дрібні об'єкти"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vật thể nhỏ"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"小物体"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"細小物件"}}}},
    "Smooth mouse steering (off: the wheel follows the cursor at once, as in OMSI)": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direcció suau amb el ratolí (desactivat: el volant segueix el cursor immediatament, com a OMSI)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sanfte Maussteuerung (aus: Das Lenkrad folgt dem Mauszeiger sofort, wie in OMSI)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Suavizar la dirección con el ratón (desactivado: el volante sigue al cursor al instante, como en OMSI)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direction à la souris adoucie (désactivé : le volant suit le curseur immédiatement, comme sur OMSI)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მაუსით რბილი მართვა (გამორთული: საჭე კურსორს მაშინვე მისდევს, როგორც OMSI-ში)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vloeiend sturen met de muis (uit: het stuur volgt onmiddellijk, zoals in OMSI)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direção suave com o mouse (desativado: o volante segue o cursor imediatamente, como no OMSI)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direção suave com o rato (desativado: o volante segue o cursor imediatamente, como no OMSI)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Плавное управление мышью (выкл.: руль сразу следует за курсором, как в OMSI)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ugladi upravljanje mišem (isključeno: volan odmah prati kursor, kao u OMSI-ju)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mjuk styrning med musen (av: ratten följer markören direkt, som i OMSI)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"平滑鼠标转向（关闭：方向盘会立即跟随鼠标，如同 OMSI）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"平滑滑鼠轉向（關閉：方向盤立即跟隨游標，如同 OMSI）"}}}},
