    "The OMSI 2 folder is the one with maps and Vehicles in it (any complete installation).": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Тэчка OMSI 2 — тая, у якой ляжаць maps і Vehicles (любая поўная ўсталёўка)."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La carpeta d'OMSI 2 és la que conté maps i Vehicles (qualsevol instal·lació completa)."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Složka OMSI 2 je ta, ve které jsou maps a Vehicles (jakákoli kompletní instalace)."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Der OMSI-2-Ordner ist der mit maps und Vehicles darin (jede vollständige Installation)."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La carpeta de OMSI 2 es la que contiene maps y Vehicles (cualquier instalación completa)."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le dossier OMSI 2 est celui qui contient maps et Vehicles (n'importe quelle installation complète)."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 फ़ोल्डर वह है जिसमें maps और Vehicles हैं (कोई भी पूरा इंस्टॉलेशन)।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Az OMSI 2 mappa az, amelyben a maps és a Vehicles van (bármely teljes telepítés)."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Folder OMSI 2 adalah folder yang berisi maps dan Vehicles (instalasi lengkap apa pun)."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La cartella di OMSI 2 è quella che contiene maps e Vehicles (qualsiasi installazione completa)."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 のフォルダとは、maps と Vehicles が入っているフォルダです (完全なインストールならどれでも可)。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2-ის საქაღალდე ის არის, რომელშიც maps და Vehicles არის (ნებისმიერი სრული ინსტალაცია)."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 қалтасы деп ішінде maps пен Vehicles бар қалтаны айтамыз (кез келген толық орнату)."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMSI 2 폴더는 maps와 Vehicles가 들어 있는 폴더입니다 