    "Up": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Уверх"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Amunt"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nahoru"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoch"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arriba"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Haut"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ऊपर"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fel"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Su"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ზემოთ"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Жоғары"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omhoog"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"W górę"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cima"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cima"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вверх"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gore"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uppåt"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yukarı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вгору"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"向上"}}}},
    "Up the throttle, down the brake, as in OMSI; off: the mouse only steers, the pedals stay on the keys": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Уверх — газ, уніз — тормаз, як у OMSI; выкл.: мыш толькі руліць, педалі застаюцца на клавішах"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Amunt l'accelerador, avall el fre, com a OMSI; desactivat: el ratolí només dirigeix, els pedals queden al teclat"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nahoru plyn, dolů brzda, jako v OMSI; vypnuto: myš jen řídí, pedály zůstávají na klávesách"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nach oben Gas, nach unten Bremse, wie in OMSI; aus: Die Maus lenkt nur, die Pedale bleiben auf der Tastatur"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arriba el acelerador, abajo el freno, como en OMSI; desactivado: el ratón solo dirige, los pedales quedan en el teclado"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En haut l'accélérateur, en bas le frein, comme sur OMSI ; désactivé : la souris ne fait que diriger, les pédales restent au clavier"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ऊपर थ्रॉटल, नीचे ब्रेक, जैसे OMSI में; बंद: माउस केवल स्टीयर करता है, पैडल कुंजियों पर रहते हैं"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fel a gáz, le a fék, mint az OMSI-ban; ki: az egér csak kormányoz, a pedálok a billentyűkön maradnak"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ke atas gas, ke bawah rem, seperti di OMSI; mati: mouse hanya menyetir, pedal tetap di tombol"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Su l'acceleratore, giù il freno, come in OMSI; disattivato: il mouse sterza soltanto, i pedali restano sui tasti"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上でアクセル、下でブレーキ（OMSI と同じ）。オフ：マウスはハンドルのみ、ペダルはキーで操作"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ზემოთ აჩქარება, ქვემოთ მუხრუჭი, როგორც OMSI-ში; გამორთული: მაუსი მხოლოდ საჭეს მართავს, პედლები კლავიშებზე რჩება"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Жоғары — газ, төмен — тежегіш, OMSI-дегідей; өшірулі: тінтуір тек рульді басқарады, педальдар пернелерде қалады"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"위로 가속, 아래로 브레이크(OMSI와 같음). 끄면 마우스는 조향만 하고 페달은 키보드로 조작"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ke atas pendikit, ke bawah brek, seperti dalam OMSI; mati: tetikus hanya mengemudi, pedal kekal pada kekunci"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omhoog gas, omlaag remmen, zoals in OMSI; uit: de muis stuurt alleen, de pedalen blijven op het toetsenbord"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"W górę gaz, w dół hamulec, jak w OMSI; wył.: mysz tylko kieruje, pedały zostają na klawiszach"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Para cima o acelerador, para baixo o freio, como no OMSI; desativado: o mouse só esterça, os pedais ficam no teclado"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Para cima o acelerador, para baixo o travão, como no OMSI; desativado: o rato só dirige, os pedais ficam no teclado"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вверх — газ, вниз — тормоз, как в OMSI; выкл.: мышь только рулит, педали остаются на клавишах"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nagore se dodaje gas, a nadole koči, kao u OMSI-ju; kada je isključeno, miš služi samo za upravljanje, a pedale ostaju na tasterima"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uppåt gas, nedåt broms, som i OMSI; av: musen styr bara, pedalerna ligger kvar på tangentbordet"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ขึ้นคือคันเร่ง ลงคือเบรก เหมือน OMSI; ปิด: เมาส์ใช้บังคับพวงมาลัยเท่านั้น แป้นเหยียบยังใช้ปุ่มคีย์บอร์ด"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pataas ang silinyador, pababa ang preno, gaya sa OMSI; naka-off: pagmamaneho lang ang mouse, nasa mga key ang mga pedal"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yukarı gaz, aşağı fren, OMSI'deki gibi; kapalı: fare yalnızca direksiyonu çevirir, pedallar tuşlarda kalır"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Угору — газ, униз — гальмо, як в OMSI; вимк.: миша лише кермує, педалі лишаються на клавішах"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lên là ga, xuống là phanh, như trong OMSI; tắt: chuột chỉ lái, bàn đạp vẫn dùng phím"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"向上为油门，向下为刹车，如同 OMSI；关闭：鼠标只控制转向，踏板仍由键盘控制"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"向上為油門，向下為煞車，如同 OMSI；關閉：滑鼠只控制轉向，踏板仍由鍵盤控制"}}}},
