    "World & memory": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Свет і памяць"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Món i memòria"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svět a paměť"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Welt & Speicher"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mundo y memoria"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Monde et mémoire"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"दुनिया और मेमोरी"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Környezet és memória"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dunia & memori"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mondo e memoria"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ワールドとメモリ"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"სამყარო და მეხსიერება"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Әлем және жад"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"월드 및 메모리"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dunia & memori"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wereld en geheugen"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Świat i pamięć"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mundo e memória"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mundo e memória"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Мир и память"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svet i pamćenje"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Värld och minne"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"โลกและหน่วยความจำ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mundo at memory"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dünya ve bellek"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Світ і пам'ять"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thế giới và bộ nhớ"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"世界与内存"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"世界及記憶體"}}}},
    "X sensitivity (left / right)": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilitat de l'eix X (esquerra / dreta)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Empfindlichkeit X (links / rechts)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidad en X (izquierda / derecha)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilité X (gauche / droite)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"X მგრძნობელობა (მარცხნივ / მარჯვნივ)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidade X (esquerda / direita)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidade X (esquerda / direita)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Чувствительность по оси X (влево / вправо)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osetljivost ose X (levo/desno)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"X 軸靈敏度（左／右）"}}}},
    "Y sensitivity (up / down)": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilitat de l'eix Y (amunt / avall)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Empfindlichkeit Y (oben / unten)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidad en Y (arriba / abajo)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilité Y (haut / bas)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Y მგრძნობელობა (ზემოთ / ქვემოთ)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidade Y (cima / baixo)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidade Y (cima / baixo)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Чувствительность по оси Y (вверх / вниз)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osetljivost ose Y (gore/dole)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Y 軸靈敏度（上／下）"}}}},
    "Yaw sensitivity (left / right)": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilitat del gir horitzontal (esquerra / dreta)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Empfindlichkeit Gieren (links / rechts)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidad de guiñada (izquierda / derecha)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilité du lacet (gauche / droite)"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"მოხვევის მგრძნობელობა (მარცხნივ / მარჯვნივ)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidade da rotação horizontal (esquerda / direita)"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sensibilidade de guinada (esquerda / direita)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Чувствительность рыскания (влево / вправо)"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osetljivost skretanja (levo/desno)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"水平旋轉靈敏度（左／右）"}}}},
    "You can choose a bus without waiting for session details. The game connects when you start driving.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Можна выбраць аўтобус, не чакаючы даных сесіі. Гульня падключыцца, калі вы пачняце ехаць."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pots triar un autobús sense esperar les dades de la sessió. El joc es connecta quan comences a conduir."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autobus můžete vybrat, aniž byste čekali na podrobnosti relace. Hra se připojí, až začnete jet."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du kannst einen Bus wählen, ohne auf die Sitzungsdetails zu warten. Das Spiel verbindet sich, wenn du losfährst."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puedes elegir un autobús sin esperar los detalles de la sesión. El juego se conecta cuando empiezas a conducir."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous pouvez choisir un bus sans attendre les détails de la session. Le jeu se connecte quand vous commencez à conduire."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आप सेशन की जानकारी का इंतज़ार किए बिना बस चुन सकते हैं। चलाना शुरू करने पर गेम जुड़ता है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Választhatsz buszt anélkül, hogy megvárnád a munkamenet adatait. A játék akkor csatlakozik, amikor elindulsz."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anda bisa memilih bus tanpa menunggu detail sesi. Game terhubung saat Anda mulai mengemudi."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puoi scegliere un autobus senza attendere i dettagli della sessione. Il gioco si connette quando inizi a guidare."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"セッション情報を待たずにバスを選べます。運転を始めると接続します。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"შეგიძლიათ აირჩიოთ ავტობუსი სესიის დეტალების მოლოდინის გარეშე. თამაში დაუკავშირდება, როცა მართვას დაიწყებთ."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сессия деректерін күтпей-ақ автобус таңдауға болады. Ойын жүруді бастағанда қосылады."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"세션 정보를 기다리지 않고 버스를 선택할 수 있습니다. 운전을 시작하면 연결됩니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anda boleh memilih bas tanpa menunggu butiran sesi. Permainan bersambung apabila anda mula memandu."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je kunt een bus kiezen zonder op de sessiegegevens te wachten. Het spel maakt verbinding als je begint te rijden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Możesz wybrać autobus bez czekania na szczegóły sesji. Gra połączy się, gdy zaczniesz jechać."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você pode escolher um ônibus sem esperar os detalhes da sessão. O jogo se conecta quando você começar a dirigir."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pode escolher um autocarro sem esperar pelos detalhes da sessão. O jogo liga-se quando começar a conduzir."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Можно выбрать автобус, не дожидаясь данных сессии. Игра подключится, когда вы начнёте поездку."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Možete izabrati autobus bez čekanja na podatke sesije. Igra će se povezati kada započnete vožnju."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du kan välja en buss utan att vänta på sessionsuppgifterna. Spelet ansluter när du börjar köra."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คุณเลือกรถบัสได้โดยไม่ต้องรอรายละเอียดเซสชัน เกมจะเชื่อมต่อเมื่อคุณเริ่มขับ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puwede kang pumili ng bus nang hindi hinihintay ang detalye ng session. Kokonekta ang laro kapag nagsimula ka nang magmaneho."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Oturum ayrıntılarını beklemeden otobüs seçebilirsiniz. Oyun, sürmeye başladığınızda bağlanır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Можна вибрати автобус, не чекаючи даних сесії. Гра підключиться, коли ви почнете їхати."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bạn có thể chọn xe buýt mà không cần chờ thông tin phiên. Trò chơi kết nối khi bạn bắt đầu lái."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你可以不等会话信息，先选择巴士。开始驾驶时才会真正连接。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你可以不等房間資料，先選擇巴士。開始駕駛時才會真正連線。"}}}},
    "Your buses show up here once added.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вашы аўтобусы з’явяцца тут пасля дадавання."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Els teus autobusos apareixen aquí un cop afegits."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvé autobusy se tu objeví, jakmile je přidáš."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deine Busse erscheinen hier, sobald sie hinzugefügt sind."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tus autobuses aparecen aquí una vez añadidos."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vos bus apparaissent ici une fois ajoutés."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"जोड़ने के बाद आपकी बसें यहाँ दिखेंगी।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A buszaid itt jelennek meg, miután hozzáadtad őket."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bus-busmu muncul di sini setelah ditambahkan."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I tuoi autobus compaiono qui una volta aggiunti."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"追加したバスはここに表示されます。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"თქვენი ავტობუსები აქ გამოჩნდება დამატების შემდეგ."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Автобустарыңыз қосылғаннан кейін осында көрсетіледі."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"추가한 버스가 여기에 표시됩니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bas anda akan dipaparkan di sini selepas ditambah."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je bussen verschijnen hier zodra ze zijn toegevoegd."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Twoje autobusy pojawią się tutaj po dodaniu."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seus ônibus aparecem aqui depois de adicionados."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os teus autocarros aparecem aqui depois de adicionados."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваши автобусы появятся здесь после добавления."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvoji autobusi se pojavljuju ovde kada ih dodaš."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dina bussar visas här när du har lagt till dem."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"รถบัสของคุณจะแสดงที่นี่เมื่อเพิ่มแล้ว"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lalabas dito ang mga bus mo kapag naidagdag na."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Otobüslerin eklendikten sonra burada görünür."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваші автобуси з’являться тут після додавання."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xe buýt của bạn sẽ hiện ở đây sau khi thêm."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"添加后，你的巴士会显示在这里。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"加入後，你的公車會顯示在這裡。"}}}},
    "Your friends paste it into Multiplayer → Connect by Code.": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Els teus amics l'enganxen a Multijugador → Connecta amb un codi."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deine Freunde fügen ihn unter Mehrspieler → Per Code verbinden ein."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tus amigos lo pegan en Multijugador → Conectar por código."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vos amis le collent dans Multijoueur → Connexion par code."}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"თქვენი მეგობრები ჩასვამენ მას: მრავალმოთამაშიანი → კოდით დაკავშირება."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seus amigos colam em Multijugador → Conectar por código."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os seus amigos colam-no em Multijogador → Ligar por código."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваши друзья вставляют его в Мультиплеер → Подключиться по коду."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prijatelji unose ovaj kod u Više igrača → Povezivanje kodom."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"朋友可將它貼到「多人遊戲 → 使用連線碼連線」。"}}}},
    "Your own buses: each keeps its number plate, its kilometres and the state you left it in.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вашы ўласныя аўтобусы: кожны захоўвае свой нумар, свой прабег і стан, у якім вы яго пакінулі."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Els teus propis autobusos: cadascun conserva la seva matrícula, els seus quilòmetres i l'estat en què el vas deixar."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvé vlastní autobusy: každý si drží svou SPZ, své kilometry a stav, v jakém jsi ho nechal."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deine eigenen Busse: Jeder behält sein Kennzeichen, seine Kilometer und den Zustand, in dem du ihn abgestellt hast."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tus propios autobuses: cada uno conserva su matrícula, sus kilómetros y el estado en que lo dejaste."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vos propres bus : chacun garde sa plaque, ses kilomètres et l’état dans lequel vous l’avez laissé."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपकी अपनी बसें: हर बस अपनी नंबर प्लेट, अपने किलोमीटर और वह हालत रखती है जिसमें आपने उसे छोड़ा था।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saját buszaid: mindegyik megőrzi a rendszámát, a kilométereit és azt az állapotot, amelyben hagytad."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bus milikmu sendiri: masing-masing menyimpan pelat nomornya, kilometernya, dan kondisi saat kamu meninggalkannya."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I tuoi autobus: ognuno conserva la sua targa, i suoi chilometri e lo stato in cui l’hai lasciato."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"あなた専用のバス：それぞれがナンバープレート、走行距離、そして最後に置いたときの状態を保ちます。"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"თქვენი საკუთარი ავტობუსები: თითოეული ინარჩუნებს სანომრე ნიშანს, კილომეტრებს და მდგომარეობას, რომელშიც დატოვეთ."}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Өз автобустарыңыз: әрқайсысы өз нөмірін, жүрген жолын және сіз қалдырған күйін сақтайды."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"나만의 버스: 각 버스는 번호판, 주행 거리, 그리고 마지막으로 두고 간 상태를 그대로 유지합니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bas milik anda sendiri: setiap satu menyimpan nombor pendaftarannya, kilometernya dan keadaan semasa anda meninggalkannya."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je eigen bussen: elke bus houdt zijn kenteken, zijn kilometers en de staat waarin je hem achterliet."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Twoje własne autobusy: każdy zachowuje swoją rejestrację, przebieg i stan, w jakim go zostawiłeś."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seus próprios ônibus: cada um mantém sua placa, sua quilometragem e o estado em que você o deixou."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os teus próprios autocarros: cada um mantém a sua matrícula, os seus quilómetros e o estado em que o deixaste."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваши собственные автобусы: каждый сохраняет свой номер, свой пробег и состояние, в котором вы его оставили."}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvoji sopstveni autobusi: svaki zadržava svoju tablicu, svoje kilometre i stanje u kom si ga ostavio."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dina egna bussar: var och en behåller sin registreringsskylt, sina kilometer och skicket du lämnade den i."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"รถบัสของคุณเอง: แต่ละคันจะเก็บป้ายทะเบียน ระยะทาง และสภาพที่คุณทิ้งไว้"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sarili mong mga bus: bawat isa ay nagtatago ng plaka nito, ng mga kilometro nito at ng kalagayang iniwan mo ito."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kendi otobüslerin: her biri plakasını, kilometresini ve onu bıraktığın durumu korur."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваші власні автобуси: кожен зберігає свій номер, свій пробіг і стан, у якому ви його залишили."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xe buýt của riêng bạn: mỗi xe giữ biển số, số km và tình trạng bạn để lại."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你自己的巴士：每辆车都保留它的车牌、里程以及你离开时的状态。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你自己的公車：每輛車都保留它的車牌、里程以及你離開時的狀態。"}}}},
    "Your own note, kept on this computer": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваша нататка, захоўваецца на гэтым камп'ютары"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La teva nota, desada en aquest ordinador"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vaše vlastní poznámka, uložená v tomto počítači"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deine eigene Notiz, auf diesem Computer gespeichert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu nota, guardada en este ordenador"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre note personnelle, gardée sur cet ordinateur"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपका अपना नोट, इसी कंप्यूटर पर रखा गया"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saját jegyzet, ezen a számítógépen tárolva"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Catatan Anda sendiri, disimpan di komputer ini"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La tua nota, salvata su questo computer"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自分用のメモ（このコンピューターに保存）"}},"ka":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"თქვენი შენიშვნა, ინახება ამ კომპიუტერზე"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Өз жазбаңыз, осы компьютерде сақталады"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 컴퓨터에 저장되는 나만의 메모"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nota anda sendiri, disimpan pada komputer ini"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je eigen notitie, bewaard op deze computer"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Twoja notatka, zapisana na tym komputerze"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sua nota, guardada neste computador"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A sua nota, guardada neste computador"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваша заметка, хранится на этом компьютере"}},"sr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vaša sopstvena beleška, sačuvana na ovom računaru"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din egen anteckning, sparad på den här datorn"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บันทึกของคุณเอง เก็บไว้ในคอมพิวเตอร์เครื่องนี้"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sarili mong tala, nakatago sa computer na ito"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kendi notunuz, bu bilgisayarda saklanır"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваша нотатка, зберігається на цьому комп'ютері"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ghi chú của riêng bạn, lưu trên máy tính này"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你自己的笔记，保存在这台电脑上"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你自己的筆記，儲存在這台電腦上"}}}},
